ering."7Stick around to fight me, and I'll show it to you."=Third gym's the charm, or something like that. Fight me?"Understood."+I'll be here until you wish to battle."DI'm gonna show you the difference between strategy and tactics!"4Just like that, my team's put to the sidelines."QA knack for tactics, that's what you got. Helena'll be impressed, I know it."CHealing centers uhh... to the west. So go off and do that now."DHealing center's uhh... to the west. So go off and do that now."`She just switches around a lot? That's the "tactics" everyone around here's been hyping up?"sI'm a bit disappointed. Well, let's avoid getting too cocky. I should actually make my attempt before judging."Bye bye!" LuxPark: A place of smiles."You one of the new hires?" Get me a coffee, chop chop."3Well, go get some, then. I don't have all day.""Wow, this is some good stuff!"<I can already feel the energy coursing through my body."?I won't be needing to tide myself over with these anymore."PWell I don't see any on you. We don't pay you to waste our time with jokes!"'This coffee ain't that great, kid."'In fact, it's awful. You're fired."9Pack up your things and leave, wherever you work at."/"LuxTech Campus, where the future begins!"" "Catch a Break" Poké Balls"5You ever have someone bother you out of nowhere?"UJust have your Pokemon give 'em one of these, and they'll leave you alone quick."Yeah, that'll do."WEither you give 'em one of those, or you bribe 'em with some stuff you don't need."3I'm figuring out vacation spots here in Makya."qVisiting the ice cave seems wonderful, but the looming threat of Avatars really throws a wrench in things..."LuxTech Main"LuxTech Campus Gym"Leader: Helena"(Shocking strategy, typhoon tactics!"&I decided to come here on a whim."This park sucks."-I can't believe they even called it one."!The door is securely locked."UA sign reads "Schedule your gym appointments in the large building to the west.""(LuxTech Sewage Engineering Entrance"'Don't you think this wall is ugly?"&Gigantic, and perfectly straight."3Kind of ruins the natural beauty of this area.":LuxTech's Makya campus is more than just a workplace."VWe're also the undisputed capital of scientific research across the whole region!"+At least that's what I tell investors."West: County Park"East: Lingering Delta"�Helena juggles leadership in this company with contract work for the Makyan government, and even then still finds time to train Pokemon for her gym."LIf you plan on facing her, you best be wary of her hit and run tactics."QMost of her Pokemon use switch-out moves: Flip Turn, Volt Switch, or U-Turn."PIf you want a leg up, hazards like Stealth Rocks and Spikes can help a lot."BOr you could trap her 'mons, so they just...can't switch out!"$Oh, I see you have a MasterDex."cI have one of those myself. I got it from when I worked under Miss – er, Professor Tamarind."?I used to help her keep the grunts from getting too rowdy."<As nice as my job is now, it's certainly less exciting."/LuxTech makes great products, and cheaply."LSetting up an office in Makya hasn't helped their PR situation, though."�In theory, they're thoroughly vetting all hires for past Chasm ties, and Helena's just an advisor... but we all know she's running the show."kNot a good look for the company that recently switched mottos to "Innovation, Inspiration, Integrity.""Yikes."LuxTech Cold Storage"S—I thought we were all on the same page about what was expected of us now…"QI don’t think <i>they</i> ever were…. never wanted to give up the power.":Technically… they had a special unit designation…"Contractors…"WIt was the same during the expeditions. Outside hires never put the mission first."(Priorities completely out of whack."LThe protection racket was bad enough. Now they’re desecrating a tomb."8I’ll bet they’ve found all four prison cells…":What are they going to do with those… disasters…?"BNothing, if I can help it. It’s the least I can do after—"	\PN!"#How much of that did you hear?"We’ll finish this later."#I’m sure you have questions."Keep them to yourself."Please…"-*sigh*...Victoire is going to kill me…"Yesterday was terrible."HI was forced to wind down the cluster I had running on the archive."6"Ecology of the Lingering Delta", my pet project."VEven worse, I had to go down into the Cold Storage basement level to do the deed."9Get your lunches, imported premium from sunny Alola!"First Strike TMs"=All of my test materials got stolen mid-shipment. Again."UApparently not everyone got the memo that Makya shouldn't work that way anymore."^I really hope that Helena can convince the Makyan Rangers to start patrolling our routes."LuxTech Condos"Mako's Malasadas"Maybe later."Sure, let's go."Don't give coffee."Give coffee.[y"wSe suponía que hoy iba a reunirme con Kurt sobre elegantemente desmantelar parte del grupo, pero nunca apareció."T¿Acaso no sabe que mantener sistemas de lealtad añade fragilidad innecesaria?"4Desearía que el vendedor aquí vendiera café."�Hay una gran demanda de este, y nadie quiere caminar a través de una cueva entera sólo para visitar la cafetería en Pueblo Novo."RSobre la caja hay estampado un logo de "Manufacturación Ciudad Romantis SA."";Tú y Helena tienen algo secreto a discutir, ¿Eso es?"sMe encantaría preguntar, pero, bueno, necesito este trabajo más de lo que necesito satisfacer mi curiosidad."2De cualquier modo, ¡Eso fue un gran combate!"!¡Un Corviknight Variocolor!"GEstá muy ocupado mirando el campus como para prestarte atención."gEs díficil ser ascendido cuando el mejor talento aquí son los antiguos sargentos del Team Chasm.">Son tan buenos combatienes. Hace que uno se ponga celoso."sEstamos intentando solucionar algunos problemas mayores con los suministros de cadenas de datos más antiguos.";Kurt y Pearce estaban hablando sobre sólo eliminarlo."yAunque sólo porque solían ser los tenientes de Helena no significa que no se enojará si los encuentra recortando!"HCerrado mientras Helena participa en el 