 Bone Treat from your bag."QYou hand the treat to the Growlithe. After a quick sniff, it eats the treat."BYou use this opportunity to put Growlithe back into its ball."2You should return the Growlithe to its owner."LAccording to the tag on its collar, the owner lives in Novo Apartments."BYou want to know how my makeup stays fresh with all this ash?"MThe truth is that I am... a beast of the forest, come to take your soul!"DBut, seriously, you don't want to know how this stuff stays on."FAnd with that mystery left alluringly open, I will take my leave."<Hahaha! You should've seen your face! It was so... you." The berry plant is growing."`Fighting alongside a Voltorb is a dangerous game, but I dribble nonetheless. It is my fate."�One day my children will ask me if I, too, had teachers, and I will say everyone who reminds me I don't explode regularly is my teacher."YThis was not a failure, for I am unexploded, and every unexploded day is a blessing.",My last batch of mushrooms went rancid."Which stinks!"BWell, to tell you the truth, I couldn't smell the difference."LSo I need to get meself acquainted with the smell of healthy mushrooms."UCould you do me a favor and bring me a mushroom Pokemon so I can get me a whiff?"-I don't have much in the way of rewards."?Suppose I could give ya what I confiscated from my nephew."?He crafted something mighty gross outta my failed harvest."-So, you gots one of them mushroom 'mons?":It's called <i>my</i>cology because <i>I</i> need it!"%Just what the Nurse Joy ordered!"2Appreciate it. Now, lemme get this over with."LThe pokemon rancher studies your Pokemon's smell closely and carefully."MHah...I can see it now. The cash rollin' in from a full healthy harvest."'Anyways, my side of the bargain...")Suppose I'll get outta yer hair now."{The true self can only be found by exploring the world, and beating the crap out of random people you find on the way!"gAfter that thrashing I'm gonna have to self-actualize extra-violently to make up! See ya in Kalos!"8Ah, a fellow seeker of enlightenment. Best of luck!"IThis is a premiere Bug-type training ground! Samorn told me herself!"Maybe I'm the worm..."6Down but not out! The true power of the Bug-type!":Samorn trains Dragon-types as well! How cool is that!" Not as cool as bugs though."#Hey! Pretty cool place, right?"5Feels like one of the more quiet areas of Makya."QMaybe because Velenz attracts all the avatars and repels most of the people.")What was up with that place, anyway?"ALike, why keep a gym there...? And that mansion to the west?"Straight up bizarre."MBut, anyway, I've got a new team here put together just for this battle."4A doubles team, too! I'm expanding my horizons."BI can promise they won't bore you to sleep. They're fun-guys."%Don't sleep on this team! Or do.",You'll probably lose if you do, though."Ready to go?"Sure thing, sleepy head."Gimmick strat, go!"!The Empty Stone? Not likely."3I mean, it's good at keeping my lunch chilled."'And it's nice to look at, I guess."OBut, when I give it to one of my Pokémon, it seems to just wear them out."JI'm gonna keep it for now, see if I can't figure out the trick later."7Either way, it won't be showing up in this battle."0Never thought I'd get to try out that team."#Always seemed like a fun idea!"\I wasn't gonna enter the tournament with it, cause I figured the chances weren't great."'It's also just not as fun in 1v1s."&Thanks for humoring me, but uh..."4What're <i>your</i> feelings on the tournament?";Yeah, definitely! Kinda part of why I'm sore about it."2I'm hoping I'll be able to catch your rounds."I'll be cheering for you."NMaybe get some vicarious joy when you inevitably get the guy who beat me.";Just kidding! Holding grudges like that is exhausting."7You sure didn't say that like it was a good thing."5I guess I never asked about your family, before."9Whatever it is, I hope things turn out well for you."]Gonna go straight through this league and tournament and onto even greater glories, huh?"?If anyone could ride that momentum it’d probably be you."SJust remember to slow down long enough for me to catch you at your coronation."=Yeah, definitely! Kinda part of why I’m sore about it."*I cheered for you during your rounds."CGot some vicarious joy watching you beat your asshole brother."3Getting a bad vibe from the way you said that."-I guess I never asked about your family."5I saw a lot of tension during that grand finale."EWell, whatever happened between you two... hope things work out."%You felt that earthquake, right?":Heard some rumors that it might have been manmade...?"BSounds like something a Champion should look into. Wink wink."7I know you’re destined for even greater glories."2So... back to my memorial tour of the region."AFor our next stop I was thinking the <imp>Split Peaks.</imp>"MDown at the south end of the mountain, where it connects to the estuary.".Oh, almost forgot, I found this mushroom."I bequeath it to you."See ya!"?I saw a band of troubadours in that cave beyond the fence."%Do you know anything about them?"/I heard boisterous exclamations of wonder.".It's ever so compelling, don't you agree?":Maybe they're up to something...something suspicious?"No"Yes"Gimme 5 minutes."	Yup!"Using that item again?"Seems fun!"It's family business."I have bigger concerns."It was fun!"It was family business.[x"GEl Murkrow te mira silenciosamente, una mirada oscura en sus ojos."Oeste: Velenz"Norte: Svait"Sur: La Plataforma""El Growlithe está temblando."qNotas una etiqueta en su collar. Aunque se está moviendo, apenas puedes notar lo que está escrito en ella."KSu dueño aparentemente vive en los Apartamentos Novo, en Pueblo Novo."7¡Oh! Es el Growlithe perdido del que te hablaron."URecordando las instrucciones que te dieron, saca un Premio de Leche de tu bolso."ULe alcanzas el premio al Growlithe. Luego de una breve olida, se come el premio."?Usas esta oportunidad para regresar a Growlithe a su ball."-Debes devolver el Growlithe a su dueño."]Según la etiqueta que lleva en el cuello, el propietario vive en los Apartamentos Novo."O¿Quiéres saber cómo mi maquillaje se queda fresco con toda esta ceniza?"TLa verdad es que soy... una bestia del bosque, ¡Que ha venido a tomar tu alma!"EPero, en serio, no quieres saber cómo esto se queda en su lugar";Y con ese misterio en el aire, es hora de mi retirada."?¡Jajaja! ¡Deberías haber visto tu cara! Era tan… tú."(El árbol de bayas está creciendo."bLuchar al lado de un Voltorb es un juego peligroso, pero aún así no pararé, es mi destino."�Algún día mis hijos me preguntarán si yo también tuve profesores, y les diré que todo aquel que me recordara no explotar regularmente es mi profesor."mEsto no fue un fracaso, porque no he explotado, y cualquier día en el que no explote es una bendición."+Mi última tanda de hongos se pudrió."¡Lo que apesta!"<Bueno, para serte sincero, no puedo oler la diferencia."IAsí que necesito hacerme familiar con el olor de hongos saludables."N¿Puedes hacerme el favor de traerme un Pokémon hongo así puedo olerlo?"#No tengo mucho en recompensas."?Supongo que puedo darte lo que le confisqué a mi sobrino."5Hizo algo bien asqueroso con mi cosecha fallida."1Entonces, ¿Tienes uno de esos 'mons hongos?"C¡Se llama <i>mi</i>cología porque <i>mi</i> ser la necesita!"-¡Justo lo que la Enfermera Joy ordenó!",Lo aprecio. Ahora, terminemos con esto."GEl ranchero estudia el olor de tu Pokémon de cerca y con cuidado."OJa...Puedo verlo ahora. El efectivo aparece desde un bosque lleno de vida."%Como sea, mi parte del trato....")Supongo que ahora te dejaré en paz."�Tu yo verdadero sólo puede ser encontrado al explorar el mundo, ¡Y vencer a cualquier entrenador aleatorio que te encuentres en el camino!"w¡Después de esa golpiza voy a tener que auto-actualizarme extra-violentamente para compensar! ¡Te veo en Kalos!"WAh, alguien más que busca el esclarecimiento. ¡Te deseo la mejor de las suertes!"a¡Esto es un campo de entrenamiento especial para tipos Bicho! ¡L