e ocurrió aquí?"lTodo este lugar no debería existir. No puedo encontrar palabras para descubrir lo que estoy sintiendo."MEs como, un sentimiento de terror. De que algo está a punto de ocurrir."ADe que un par de palabras podría causar que algo despierte."H¡Detente! ¡La ley claramente dice que esta es una acción ilegal!"[Una estación ranger está arriba de nosotros, en Grouz. Lo sé porque lo vi yo misma."7Iré allí para reportar tus actividades ilegales."RComo una agente de la ley, estoy decepcionada de que no haya podido vencerte."G¡Estoy seguro de que habrá un Pokémon raro que encontrar aquí!"\Antiguos reportes Chasm hablan sobre un gigante metálico acechando entre los árboles."KAlgo que no esperaban ver aquí, por lo que no me refiero a Registeel."4Quizás tú podrás encontrarlos. Buena suerte."9Atrapar una derrota como esa no estaba en mi agenda.;[*",The alloyed blade crumbled into pieces."5I can sense the life force of all living things."JWhat makes this chamber so fearful is that... I cannot sense a thing."8I'll have to report this failure back to my master.",I could not find the elixir of legends."<I have vanquished all manner of monster to arrive here."9For skill enough to defeat me, I deeply respect you."But nothing happened..."I am camped out here.")There is no reason to be suspicious."@I had forgotten, but my camping spot is actually elsewhere."Please do not follow me."@Roasting smores. That is an aspect of camping that I enjoy.")I love flowers. Do you love flowers?"_I must go. The reason certainly involves aromas, for that is what category of person I am.":Smelling flowers. Their aroma. It is simply the best."dThe hike out here was quite nice. A battle will be a good way to end my trip. Let us begin now."<I assure you that my interest in hiking is very normal."1To prove it, I will now hike away from here."JBattling is very similar to rock climbing, in that I partake in both.""An extreme force pushes back!"eTrimmed metallic vines hang from the wall. There's not enough material to make anything further."KThere was an entire cave of iron plants and no one mentioned it to me?"$Isn't that a little suspicious?"?But who among us knows the truth about what happened here?"VThis whole place shouldn't exist. I can't find words to describe how I'm feeling."FIt's like, a feeling of dread. That something is about to happen."7That a few words could cause something to wake up."AStop! The law states clearly that this is an illegal action!"QA ranger station is above us, in Grouz. I know that because I saw it myself."7I will go there to report your illegal activities."TAs an agent of the law, I am dissapointed that I was not able to overpower you.":I'm sure there'll be some rare Pokémon to find here!"MEarly Chasm reports talk about a metallic giant lurking among the trees."JSomething they didn't expect to see here, so, I don't mean Registeel."0Maybe you'll be able to find it. Good luck."5Collecting a loss like that wasn't on my agenda.Iu;␀E[[D"EOne moment – there we go. I’m going to take notes this time."bI’ll admit it: I’m curious. What do you bring to the table that no other challenger does?"`No matter what praise Tamarind or the others heap upon you, don’t let it go to your head."/I’m rather more rigorous in my analyses."Let’s begin."?All of that work to get here and now you test my patience?"-Ugh. Go. I can work while you’re gone."*I reared Team Chasm from its infancy."<I turned this place from wilderness to a modern region."%I am the beating heart of Makya."HFine! One of us needs to be humbled. Show me which one of us it is."QDon’t expect this to be easy simply because I work from behind the scenes.")I made this region what it is today."]Show me what you can do – or are you just what you’ve inherited from Mavis? Show me!"SNo! I can’t – how? Eight years and I still can’t beat an arrogant child!">No, no, you and your Pokémon deserve the Patience Badge."8No, no, you and your Pokémon deserve that victory."sJust do me a favor and beat Tamarind just as badly someday. You’re not the only one with a childish rivalry."^Although – and you may know where I’m going with this – there is one other thing..."@My decision to not employ gym trainers is paying dividends."2Now there’s no one to watch me keep losing."5Your victory was unexpected, but not undeserved."/You’re not the child I thought you were."(I’m happy to give you this badge."dOh, and I would be very interested in another duel – there’s more for me to learn from you."MI’ll make the time, whenever you want to give me yours. Good day, \PN."FA screensaver image of a Luxray bounces lazily around the screen."Yo, champ in the making!"*Helena runs a tight ship around here."=Even I can't get away with just standing around all day!"oHelena understands that efficiency comes from information, and information from the flow of communication."RThat's why she's focused her gym around Electric-type and Water-type Pokemon!"=They're a strong pair in battles, sharing no weaknesses."Firstly, Grass-type Pokemon are your best bet against her, since they're strong against Water- types, and resist Electric."JSecondarily, Dragon-type Pokemon will resist both Water and Electric."UFinally, mirroring her with Electric-type Pokemon of your own can work well too."=They're strong against Water-types, and resist Electric."Hope that helps!"5You out-maneuvered Team Chasm's best strategist!":Congratulations, I hope you feel good about that one!"gWe were initially hesitant to partake in constructing gyms, but we chose to do so for two reasons."%Firstly, it provided legitimacy."KSecondly, it allowed us to find exceptional trainers such as yourself."~I would like you to take this key, with the understanding that through the door it unlocks is a particularly dangerous avatar."4Obliterate it. Show me that our search is over."QYou'll find the problem at the north wall of Team Chasm HQ. Well, former HQ."uThe avatar still exists. I’m patient, but I would be lying if I said I didn’t yearn for the day it was gone."+It is my most-despised responsibility.",Search the north wall of Team Chasm HQ."It’s gone?"~I never thought I’d share Andris’s joy in seeing a problem -- how would he put it? -- deep-sixed, but this does feel good."[Thank you. That’s a weight off of my shoulders, not to mention proof my idea worked."Good day, \PN."And thank you."Oh... good. You."6I’m going to be honest: I’m not really a fan."GOh, don’t take it personally. I don’t like anyone around here."OAs soon as I’ve got my fortune, I’m leaving this damned region behind."yI’m going to live on a megayacht in the warm Alolan waters, writing semi-autobiographical erotica under a penname.";And I never have to think about any of you ever again."\Well, maybe I’ll invite Tamarind. Just to rub it in her face, of course. Of course..."Not yet."Let's.[D";Un momento – ahí está. Esta vez voy a tomar notas."\Lo admitiré: tengo curiosidad. ¿Qué traes a la mesa que ningún otro aspirante hace?"iNo importa cuantos elogios Tamarind u otros hayan apilado sobre ti, no los dejes llegar a tu cabeza."(Soy más rigurosa en mis análisis."Empecemos."I¿Todo ese trabajo para llegar aquí y ahora desafías mi paciencia?"5Ugh. Vete. Puedo trabajar mientras estás fuera.",Formé al Team Chasm desde sus inicios."9Convertí este lugar salvaje en una región moderna."'Soy el corazón latiente de Makya."h¡Bien! Uno de nosotros recibirá una lección de humildad. Muéstrame quién de nosotros lo será."RNo esperes que esto sea fácil simplemente porque trabajo detrás de escenas."(Yo hice esta región lo que es hoy."_Muéstrame lo que puedes hacer – ¿o sólo eres lo que heredaste de Mavis? ¡Muéstrmae!"^¡No! No puedo – ¿cómo? ¡Ocho años y todavía no puedo vencer a un niño arrogante!"=No, no, tú y tus Pokémon merecen la Medalla Paciencia."5No, no, tú y tus Pokémon merecen esa victoria."xSólo hazme el favor de vencer a Tamarind del mismo modo algún día. No eres el único con una rivalidad infantil."PAunque – y puede que sepas 