Here."!Wish me luck facing my boss.[#"[Estoy estudiando el proceso del crecimiento de bayas en cuevas y ambientes semejantes."¡Toma algunas si quieres!""Cuidado con el lodo, eso sí."Sur: Villa Casaba"Norte: Costa Volcánica"9Vine aquí para redescubrir mi amor por la aventura."9¿Te importaría demasiado si llegaramos a combatir?"&Me avergonzaste de sobremanera…"SEso fue muy disfrutable, ¡Quizá deberíamos cruzar Pokémon alguna otra vez!"1Hay un poco más de texto, pero es ilegible."¡Por favor ten cuidado!"`Estos espacios moteados en el suelo son áreas donde los Pokémon salvajes pueden atacarte."R¡Por favor evitalos si no estás listo para enfrentarte a Pokémon salvajes!"(El árbol de bayas está creciendo." Te has fugado con mi hongo."�Olvida mis meditacions sobre su estructura, sustento, y fuete - seguro que tus caprichos triunfan cualquiera de mis preocupaciones."S¿Debo entretener a extraños ahora? Estamos esperando por un arribo fortuito.".Pero no por idea mía, dejemos eso claro."BY aún así, quizás ella no estaba completamente equivocada."JLa naturaleza férrea de tu espíritu es aparente a mi incluso ahora."3¿Hablarías con mi acompañante, por ventura?"&Ella está descansando en el sur."RMe quedaré aquí contemplando la impermanencia de... bueno, hongos, supongo.">Si puedes, retírate, este hongo llama toda mi atención."[Nos quedamos sin dulces en el resort, así que estamos empleando medidas desesperadas."nEl mineral azull allí es comestible. Y bastante energizante, si mis compañero de trabajo tienen razón."VExcepto... que no creo que pueda forzarme a servirle rocas a nuestros huéspedes."SAsí que, decidí darle mi equipo de minería al primer entrenador que pasara."
Toma."-Deséame suerte para hablar con mi jefe.;[#"UI'm studying the process of growing berries in caves and cave-like environments."Feel free to take some!" Careful in the mud, though."South: Casaba Villa"North: Volcanic Shore"4I came here to rediscover my love of adventure."1Would you mind awfully if we were to battle?"%You have thoroughly shamed me..."DThat was most enjoyable, perhaps we shall cross Pokémon again!"5There's another bit of text, but it's illegible."Please be advised!"NThe mottled spots of ground are areas where wild Pokémon can attack you."EPlease avoid them if you aren't ready to fend off wild Pokémon!" The berry plant is growing."'You have absconded with my fungus."zNevermind my meditations upon its structure, sustenance, and provenance - surely your whims trump any of my concerns."\Must I entertain strangers even now? We are waiting for a sudden serendipitous arrival."2By no idea of mine, let me make myself clear."1And yet, perhaps she was not entirely wrong."EThe steel-grey nature of your spirit is apparent to me even now."2Would you speak with my companion, perchance?"!She is resting to the south."WI shall remain here and contemplate the impermanence of... well, fungi, I suppose."KIf you would take your leave, this mushroom demands my full attention."PWe ran out of sweets at the resort, so we're turning to desperate measures."eThe blue mineral over there is edible. And quite energizing, if my coworkers are to be believed."MExcept... I don't think I can bring myself to serve rocks to our guests."TSo, I decided to give my mining tool away to the first trainer to pass through."
Here."!Wish me luck facing my boss.Iu;␀h[["'A few cookbooks have been set out."3A pantry full of Pokémon food and seasonings."cFramed photographs of an excessively chubby Glameow and a very droopy Yamper look down at you."1A well-crafted sculpture of a tormented man."*A signature on the base reads "Noel"."'Coffee-table books about fine art."\It would certainly suck for the owners of this house to come back to a dripping faucet."BThat said, they probably wouldn't even notice the water bill.",A full faceplate fossil of a Bastiodon."'You're pretty sure it's a replica."nYou spend a minute wondering if it's possible to wall-mount something as heavy as a real Bastiodon plate."-Leather-bound volumes with gilded edges."*They've gathered quite a bit of dust."A clean gas range stove."*A cheerful painting in a dusty frame."4Empty, save for a single container in the back."KYou highly doubt that whatever food was in it was the color it is now."A little dry."This clock has stopped.["'A few cookbooks have been set out."3A pantry full of Pokémon food and seasonings."cFramed photographs of an excessively chubby Glameow and a very droopy Yamper look down at you."1A well-crafted sculpture of a tormented man."*A signature on the base reads "Noel"."'Coffee-table books about fine art."\It would certainly suck for the owners of this house to come back to a dripping faucet."BThat said, they probably wouldn't even notice the water bill.",A full faceplate fossil of a Bastiodon."'You're pretty sure it's a replica."nYou spend a minute wondering if it's possible to wall-mount something as heavy as a real Bastiodon plate."-Leather-bound volumes with gilded edges."*They've gathered quite a bit of dust."A clean gas range stove."*A cheerful painting in a dusty frame."4Empty, save for a single container in the back."KYou highly doubt that whatever food was in it was the color it is now."A little dry."This clock has stopped.;["'A few cookbooks have been set out."3A pantry full of Poké