od idea."LRock is effective against Fire and Steel is immune to Poison after all."bImagine my horror, because I forgot Steel types aren't immune to the poison status condition.".My poor Aron got worn down in an instant!"8Since then, I always carry Pecha Berries with me..."5Heal Bell would be so nice to have for this gym."1I did a mistake letting my Skitty forget it."VI'll have to visit the Move Maniac so my Skitty can <imp>relearn</imp> Heal Bell."`He's hanging in the Novo PokeCenter.... and in practically every other PokeCenter, somehow."|At the northernmost part of the Shipping Lane there is a house, and inside of that house a cave, and in that cave an Avatar!"Destroy it!"cI’ve been waiting years to find a trainer good enough to eradicate it, and you’re the one!"KThis key will get you inside, and then just, well, do what I would do!"DOh, and be a dear and don’t ask anymore questions. Good luck!"rIt waits in the suspicious house in the Shipping Lane! Destroy it, and rid me of the damnable thing for good!"hOh? Have you sent the avatar back from whence it came?! Excellent! Your talents are second-to-none!")I thought this gym would be a cinch."EA whole team of fish couldn't possibly lose to a Fire- type gym!":I totally forgot that Poison is strong against Water."TWhat, do you miss the lick of flames and bite of acid? Shall we duel once more?"$Congratulations on reaching me!"TAnd congratulations to all your Pokémon! Especially the ones that are on fire!"XShow us what you’re made of and push through that pain! Just a little longer now!"(Are you ready for the grand finale?"ZGo on, then! Take a minute! Get your Pokémon some antidotes, or a fire extinguisher!"PVery well, challenger! I present to you the fullest onslaught I can muster!"3Every other gym leader is a coward, but not I!"II know that there is only way to test someone: Over! Whelming! PAIN!"Now overcome it, or fall!"ILovely! Make no mistake: my panoply of agony takes no half measures."7I’ll test you with fire 