ar más tarde!"¡Para atrapar más peces!"¡Pescar! ¡Peces!"Maldito sea ese Sunflora."wNunca pensarías que ese sería un problema, pero estos "Avatares", pero no les gusta ir por las reglas del juego."8Esos girasoles antinaturales son prueba suficiente."B¿Qué? ¿Pensabas que me gustaban esas flores horripilantes?"No"Sí;["$I've been fishing by the river."WI caught this weird fish. It's weird and ugly, with like five of these arm things."&It doesn't even look like a fish."fApparently some of them are pink and some of them are blue, but I don't care, I hate both colors."VDaddy says we need to cut down all those flowers outside, so gimme a Bushwhacker.")I'll trade you the ugly fish for it."EThis thing is ugly and dumb. Maybe I should throw it at someone."DThis fish is really ugly. I don't want to be by it much longer."Goodbye, ugly fish!"#The ugly fish is gone! Hurray!"#I'm going to go fishing later!"To catch more fish!"Fish! Fish!"Confound that Sunflora."_You'd never think one'd be a problem, but these "Avatars" don't like playin' by the rules."0Them unnatural sunflowers are proof enough."5What? You thought I liked those orange eyesores?"No"YesIu;␀$[["It attacks!["¡Ataca!;["It attacks!Iu;␀J[[-"fIt's a statue of a Luxray. A small version of the LuxTech logo is emblazoned on its right breast."�I got a crate of this fancy LuxTech brand whitening toothpaste for my Totodile. Figured it'd give her a leg up in contests back home."pInstead she's just eating it straight from the tube! Keeps hunting it down, too, no matter where I hide it."SThis is the last one. Quick, take it before she spots you - it's for the best."}Don't know what they put in that stuff that makes her go crazy over it. Wonder if they make mint-flavored Pokéblocks..."7A party game is loaded to the level select screen.")A pile of tabloids on Pokémon Sumo."?On one cover you see a Rhyperior and Gigachu squaring off."L"A rocky start. A shocking upset. All the stats that YOU need to know."