[[-"CAndris gave each of us -- us gym leaders -- one of these keys.".They’re for these doors, these prisons."{Behind all that bluster about Champions and badges and all that, this is our real purpose. At least, it’s supposed to be."9Seems like I’m the only one taking this seriously."PSo, please, take this key, go through that door, and get rid of that thing."WYou gonna go after the avatar? Until it’s gone, I can’t leave... just in case."Just. In. Case.":You’re back? Really? I mean, fine, but please stop."bAnother challenger? How inhospitable does this place have to get before you lunatics give up?"ODo I look like I have the time to duel you? That isn’t my job, you know."cMy job is to guard this door until I can find someone strong enough to defeat what’s inside."jAnd for some insane reason they thought sending a parade of children at me was a good way to do that."But fine. We’ll fight."9I run doubles, and doubles only. You ready for that?"4Great. Maybe I can get some soil samples today."*I used to be a scientist, you know..."9You’ve got the aura of someone with real audacity."}The only reason I’m here is to find a true Pokémon master, and you’ve at least got the ferocity fighting your way to me."5Fine. You’re here for more than an easy badge."Show me what you got."mSure thing. The sooner I lose to you, the sooner you get out of here and back somewhere safe, I suppose."Do it."HFinally. How many years and I finally – it’s done! It’s done!"AYou. Take the Reverence Badge. You’ve more than earned it.",Now, this door. My true responsibility."&This damn burden... let’s talk."%Yep. You’re still pretty good."&I can’t give you another badge."Please leave me alone."I hope you’re happy."_Suicidal dive into dangerous territory, hunt me down, force me to waste time fighting you.""And for what, a big old game?"Take your badge."vAnd, yeah, I’m not angry with you, got it? I’m angry with Helena and Andris and everyone for setting this up." Now get outta here, ‘kay?")Plea