ant one...? Uh... not for free."How much do these cost...?"5I'll ask for $3000. That sounds fair... I think."Thanks.""Oh, right, yeah... the thing."#I'm gonna go... walk this off.")You don't have enough money. Bummer."Ok.;[ "_I've been assigned here to help with the avatar problem, but I don't really feel up to it."@Are you looking for the Gym Leader? I've only heard rumors."8Apparently he's shacked up in one of the buildings."Dunno which one though."-Well. I'll just be here. Chilling. Yeah."(I am chill. Calm. Relaxed. Chilled."Hello again.",You... wanna buy my last Stealth Spray?"I've... decided. $3000."Hi." Oh... why am I transparent?"1Yeah I suppose that does look a bit strange."Hm. Well..."2I sprayed myself with Stealth. Using an item."&The item is called Stealth Spray."GMakes you invisible, sorta. Like how avatars are invisible, sorta."-I thought... maybe they'd talk to me...?"My plan, uh..."...didn't work."8I bought a couple. Want one...? Uh... not for free."How much do these cost...?"5I'll ask for $3000. That sounds fair... I think."Thanks.""Oh, right, yeah... the thing."#I'm gonna go... walk this off.")You don't have enough money. Bummer."Ok.00Iu;␀[[1"OSo it’s you again. I presume my impostor’s amulet is keeping you safe?"4My name – our name – is <imp>Imogene</imp>."LThe Ditto is around here somewhere, I imagine. I can’t ever lose her."CWe were wandering Kalos before deciding to come home to Makya."HIf we can settle this matter of identity anywhere, it will be here.",And as for this cave, I have a request."AIndeed you can. I did not choose this barren cave at random."\It is a place of power, and I intend to prove myself the real Imogene once and for all."*sigh*"vI am the real Imogene. The other woman that looks like me is my Ditto doppelganger, who claims just the opposite."3And I would like prove her wrong here and now."cFire-cracked bones can be read to divine the future. Ice forms a mirror that reflects oneself."iLet us combine the two – crater this ice with a duel and see our true identities in the fractures."cNot without me you don’t! I’d rather you hex me than try and perform a reading without me!"2The both of us, against our beloved traveler!"AFine… I’ll hold my horses. But don’t leave us waiting."FGood! Quail before my inner fire, and reveal your soul to my eye!")…You battle with shocking clarity.")Unbowed, even before the both of us."Fascinating…"9These hairline fractures… the ice shrapnel… hmm."%It portends nonsense. Gibberish."?That both of us are dead already, and the same regardless."AAnd look at the scarring around our oh-so-helpful ritualist?"So your name is \PN."[And, what, you will walk backwards? You are a bridge that opposes heroes and villains?"ESomething about nostalgia, but I think you stepped on that part."gNothing of use, then. Not to us, at least. I hope our makeshift augury at least did you some good."aIf not, forgive this flight of fancy wasting your time. Remember: SHE came up with the idea."IHmm… maybe this trip was worth more than that changeling imagines."ZIf you ever find yourself in the <imp>urban expanse</imp> with naught to do, find me."dI’ll be in the <imp>business sector</imp>, like as not. I have plans involving you and yours."Whoa! Is all well?"[Here – I suppose I can spare some supplies. Let us get your team in shape, shall we?"0Go find out if my… companion… is ready.".She requires far more preparation than I."Have you made ready?"iIf you ever find yourself in the <imp>urban expanse</imp> of Prizca West with naught to do, find me."iI’ll be mourning near <imp>Bogdan Cement</imp>, like as not. I have plans involving you and yours."Why are you here?"Can I help?"...What?"Hold up."Let's go.[1"aAsí que eres tú de nuevo. ¿Presumo que mi amuleto del impostor te mantiene con seguridad?"<Mi nombre – nuestro nombre – es <imp>Imogene</imp>."IEl Ditto está por aquí en algún lado, imagino. No puedo perderla."SEstabamos merodeando en Kalos antes de decidir venir a nuestro hogar en Makya."OSi podemos resolver este tema de la identidad en algún lado, será aquí.".Y respecto a esta cueva, tengo un pedido."EPor supuesto puedes. No elegí esta árida cueva aleatoriamente."kEs un lugar de poder, y tengo la intención de probar que yo soy la Imogene real de una vez por todas."*sigh*"oYo soy la Imogene real. La otra mujer que luce como yo es mi Ditto doppelganger, quien clama lo contrario."8Y yo quiero demostrarle lo contrario aquí y ahora."{Los huesos rotos por el fuego pueden ser leídos para adivinar el futuro. El hielo forma un espejo que refleja a uno mismo."tCombinemos los dos – quiebra este hielo a un duelo y veamos nuestras verdaderas identidades en las fracturas."l¡No lo hagas sin mí! ¡Preferiría que me hechizaras antes de intentar y realizar una lectura sin mi!"4Nosotras dos, ¡Contra nuestro querido viajero!"4Bien… Esperaré. Pero no nos dejes esperando."L¡Bien! Estremecete ante mi fuego interno, ¡Y revela tu alma a mi ojo!"-…Combates con una claridad impactante."1Indomable, incluso ante a ambas de nosotras."Fascinante…"FEstas fracturas en las entradas… las metrallas de hielo… hmm."*Augura cosas sin sentido. Tonterías.":Que ambas ya estamos muertas, y lo mismo pese a todo."K¿Y mira a la cicatriz alrededor de nuestro ritualista de tanta ayuda?"Así que tu nombre es \PN."VY, qué, ¿Caminarás al revés? ¿Eres el puente que opone a héroes y villanos?"GAlgo sobre nostalgia, pero creo que has pisoteado sobre esa parte."~Nada útil, entonces. No para nosotras, al menos. Espero que por lo menos nuestro augurio improviso te haya hecho algún bien."kSi no, perdona esta elucubración por hacer perder tu tiempo. Recuerda: a ELLA se le ocurrió la idea."MHmm… Quizás este viaje valió más que esa imaginación de un cambio."fSi algún día te encuentras en la <imp>expansión urbana</imp> sin nada que hacer, encuéntrame."ZEstaré en el <imp>sector urbano</imp>, como si nada. Tengo planes que te involucran."¡Wow! ¿Está todo bien?"iToma – Se supone que puedo dar un par de suministros. Pongamos a tu equipo en forma, ¿Está bien?"7Ve a averiguar si mi… compañera… está lista."2Ella requiere mucha más preparación que yo."¿Empezamos?"iIf you ever find yourself in the <imp>urban expanse</imp> of Prizca West with naught to do, find me."iI’ll be mourning near <imp>Bogdan Cement</imp>, like as not. I have plans involving you and yours."¿Por qué estás aquí?"¿Puedo ayudar?"¿...Qué?"Un momento."Vamos allá.;[1"OSo it’s you again. I presume my impostor’s amulet is keeping you safe?"4My name – our name – is <imp>Imogene</imp>."LThe Ditto is around here somewhere, I imagine. I can’t ever lose her."CWe were wandering Kalos before deciding to come home to Makya."HIf we can settle this matter of identity anywhere, it will be here.",And as for this cave, I have a request."AIndeed you can. I did not choose this barren cave at random."\It is a place of power, and I intend to prove myself the real Imogene once and for all."*sigh*"vI am the real Imogene. The other woman that looks like me is my Ditto doppelganger, who claims just the opposite."3And I would like prove her wrong here and now."cFire-cracked bones can be read to divine the future. Ice forms a mirror that reflects oneself."iLet us combine the two – crater this ice with a duel and see our true identities in the fractures."cNot without me you don’t! I’d rather you hex me than try and perform a reading without me!"2The both of us, against our beloved traveler!"AFine… I’ll hold my horses. But don’t leave us waiting."FGood! Quail before my inner fire, and reveal your soul to my eye!")…You battle with shocking clarity.")Unbowed, even before the both of us."Fascinating…"9These hairline fractures… the ice shrapnel… hmm."%It portends nonsense. Gibberish."?That both of us are dead already, and the same regardless."AAnd look at the scarring around our oh-so-helpful ritualist?"So your name is \PN."[And, what, you will walk backwards? You are a bridge that opposes heroes and vil