: it’s your job now. Always was, lookin’ at it a certain kinda way."_Go down there. Talk some sense into her. Y’know how. Ain’t much else to say, is there?"NYou know whatcha gotta do. Don’t need me holdin’ your hand. Good kid."^Oh, don’tcha go thankin’ me yet. I ain’t done nothin’ for ya. Nothin’ material."I was plannin’ to."�I ain’t ‘bout to go down there myself with ya – it’s a private affair. Can’t ruin my reputation by barging on in and making a muck of things."`Hah. Don’t embarrass me. Maybe after all’s said and done, we can grab a drink together."@You, me, Yez... or just you and me, if that’s your drift."QJust don’tcha go being one of those folks asking me to step on ‘em. Hah!"BYou’re gonna need a li’l help to get to tomorrow, though."�Take my Heatran. I don’t see myself fightin’ too many wars in my near future, and for anythin’ less my regulars will do well enough."7You, though? You oughta take anything you can get."ATake good care of that damn thing, y’hear? We go way back."rAnd, besides, it’s a damn juggernaut that can wreak more carnage than a babyface like you can even imagine."wHah! I ain’t never been able to tell if you’re brave or stupid. In my experience, they ain’t much different."ZAs you say, though. Ain’t gonna complain 'bout keepin’ an extra ace up my sleeve."�Well, I s’pose we oughta keep it brief, all things considered. You gotta go hunt that girl down, and I gotta go prep for either which way it ends."I’ll be seein’ her soon, one way or another. Probably won’t be too keen on seein’ me, but that’s friends for ya."SHey, \PN, I figure this comes as an awful surprise to you, but I got a secret."�Up until now, I’ve been workin’ with Yez, clandestine-like. Masked, causin’ havoc, fightin’ you. I ain’t proud of it, but it ain’t far from my usual."xI’m a black ops gal born and raised, though I’m a mite more on the side of cut-and-burn than cloak-and- dagger."rI ain’t 'bout to apologize. But, uh, Yez’d have me stoppin’ you, and I ain’t 'bout to play that game."IShe got other lackeys, good on her, but I ain't gonna be one of 'em."1Go ruin her day, kid. I’ll see you around."fHey, next time I see ya, drinks are on me. Call it my way of making up to you. Heh. So long, kid."X\PN, go ruin her day. I wish I was good enough to do it myself, but I just ain’t."RYou understand her well enough. She’ll listen to you, one way or the other."~And, uh, sorry. For makin’ this all ‘bout her. If things were any different, I’d love to chat ‘bout other things."<Maybe some day, yeah? I’ll see you around, I promise."nYou come back and there’s still bars left in the world, drinks are on me, y’hear? See ya around, kid."3A booklet emblazoned with the Team Chasm logo."...Your phone is ringing."2It’s... your mother. It’s Mavis. Pick up?"8Hey, \PN? I’ve been trying to call you for hours!"�Congratulations! You decimated Zain in the tournament, and my boots on the ground are telling me that you’ve done some extracurriculars."[Saved the region, I hear? Very impressive, \PN. You shattered my wildest expectations."�Now, I haven’t been able to get in contact with Zain, but to be honest, after that showing...? I’m not sure we have much to talk about right now."sIgnore him, though. He’s just moping because he couldn’t beat you. To be honest, I never thought he could."�Today’s about you. Aww, honey, you did so well! I can get a private flight scheduled to get you back home ASAP. I’ve got big plans for you."�You are my number one asset right now, and I want to show you the vacation you deserve. Business can wait – but there will be business."qWith your skills and my influence, I’ll secure you an exceedingly comfortable position within the company.".So, what date works for you to come home?"bTomorrow morning? Or do you want to sleep in? We’ll make it tomorrow evening, just in case."YYou – you what? Excuse me? Is there some kind of arrangement I don’t know about?"_Are you – are you eloping? Have you been offered a job there? You do understand what –"FOh, good. I’ll start making plans for our vacation immediately."#You’ve worked so hard and..."AMavis continues on for a few minutes before she lets you go."JShe says she loves you, and goodbye, and she’ll see you again soon."MYou’ll tell her that a certain someone said hi when you meet her next.":You’ll be her second-in-command and second-to-last."0...You thought it’d make you feel warmer."9You’ve never not picked up for your mother before."&It’s Mavis. You have to answer."...No, you don’t.",Thanks for completing Pokemon Tectonic!"UPlease consider filling out the Playtest Survey that is linked on the main menu."?Your feedback helps a lot to continue to improve the game."2You? I... I remember... outside of Novo Town.">You aren’t – I mean, you are – it doesn’t matter."OYou’re here. I’m here. I have more Pokémon to train. A duel? Doubles.":W-well, I could ask you the same thing. Can we start?"?Then go! Don’t bother me and then not even – whatever."5But you’re not getting past me without a duel."-Good. OK. No more talking. Just... this."9That was -- you’re... yeah, you are, aren’t you?"fIf you’re looking deeper in the caves, then I -- I mean, if you don’t mind, may I come along?"�I have healing items for the both of us. It’s dangerous and we -- I’d like to talk. And that’s... that’s not very common for me."ASo? I’m not moving until I get a double battle out of you.",I need to... oh, just fight me already!":That was – you’re... yeah, you are, aren’t you?"gIf you’re looking deeper in the caves, then I – I mean, if you don’t mind, may I come along?";Ah, you’re back. I, uh, don’t have much to do yet.".And we still haven’t finished our talk."2Some loose paper displaying the LuxTech logo."LLeaving through -- oh. You -- you’re looking for something down here."2Come back and, uh, I’ll still be... around." So you lead with \pfp, hmm?".Tell me – would you tell me about them?"-Good, good. You seem to be good friends."hMy Togekiss, Artemisia, has been mine since I was – oh, sorry. I shouldn’t... let’s continue.".Oh, is that so? Well, maybe it’ll grow."bMy Togekiss, Artemisia, used to be a liability, but she became my most trusted – excuse me.":I’m – why am I – whatever. Let’s keep moving."%I’m glad you found them, then."bThe only reason I have Artemisia, my Togekiss, is a story about a Togekiss from my childhood."MI’ve loved – sorry. I’m getting carried away – let’s continue."*Hah, well, I know what that’s like."QI rarely get to use my true team – my, uh, friends give me teams to train."mMy Togekiss, Artemisia, gets used more for flying than – oh, I’m – excuse me. Let’s keep moving."RAnother avatar... so strange. They aren’t spirits – not like Ghost-types."cI’ve never found an avatar of a man-made Pokémon, but there are avatars of fossil Pokémon."Almost as if... hmm." What do you think they are?"AOh – uh, I’m sorry, I’m not used to getting responses."I mostly talk to Pokémon."GPlease excuse my rambling, I – but you’re right. Nobody knows."COh – I suppose – sorry, I’m used to talking to Pokémon."AI’m not used to my rambling being – I mean, I’m sorry."/You said illusions? And yet they... hmm..."VOh – you – I’m sorry, excuse my ramblings. I usually talk to, um, Pokémon."/And they don’t – I mean – ignore me.">But you have a good hypothesis, I think. Except... hmm..."mOh – I didn’t – sorry. Excuse me, I forgot that you – I mean, I’m used to talking to Pokémon."EI’m – I’m not used to… whatever. Forget I said anything.":Were you down here for this – whatever all this is?"'That Linoone dragged it down here."8Even if you weren’t… it’s valuable. Trust me."3Barter and blackmail are Makya’s currencies."SAnd this <imp>Chasm keycard</imp> – I haven’t – it’s been a long time."<Take it. I don’t need it, and Helena won’t miss it.";It’ll get you into some <imp>dangerous places</imp>."I used to – oh."XOh. Oh, I just – I – I’m sorry. I shouldn’t be imposing upon you like this."KI’ve been stalking you – I just – my name’s <imp>Yezera</imp>."Yours?"0Well, \PN, you... you’re easy to talk to."VAlmost like a Pokémon, and I just – I’ve never found someone… I’m sorry.";I just keep talking and – I should go. I need to go."eOh – I mean, yes, that’s... I’m sorry. I’m a stranger, I shouldn’t’ve – I’ll go."But thank you."�I – I haven’t talked to someone in... a little while, and you’re… I don’t know why but you’re easy to – I’m sorry."I should go."I know."So now what?"You like me?"
Fine."My pleasure."It should be you."Just a moment."Let's go."
Nope."Thanks."Help me."I like you too."Take Heatran."Refuse Heatran forever."Pick up."Don't pick up."I'm not coming home."That sounds nice."What are you doing here?"Not now."OK."It's reliable."It's lackluster."It's my favorite."I'm just training it."I don't know."Illusions."Myths made real."I don't care."Tell her."Don't tell her.Iu;␀�Q[[�"wMy mom told me not to come up here, but I really wanted to see what it was like to pee off the side of a mountain.";I uh... don't need to pee anymore. For no real reason."{I felt like peeing off Makya's highest point would be great, but I'm not feeling as liberated as I thought I would be."WI'm scared of heights, but I'm more scared of growing old without making memories."4That's why I choose where I pee very carefully."^\PN! My beloved! The mountains frame your beauty in a way I can only describe as sublime."TYou look as if you could tear them down around you and build yourself a throne."-You don’t need to. All you need is me."oOf course. I always have time to talk with you. Listening to your dulcet voice makes my worries dissipate."1We can talk about anything. Anything at all."GWhy would you come here if not for me? You could’ve stayed away."sWhat draws you to me? You know what it is, I think. We both know. I’d love to show you what you really feel."oYou’re perfect. I see all my love reflected in your eyes. It’s beautiful. I want to hold you so badly."1Oh, you’re adorable. Such a pure creature."zYes, my love. Always gifts. I’ll get you anything you desire, always. You’re worth more than any material object."!...But that must come later."P\PN. I had planned to propose to you here. But then I was gifted a miracle."pMy undying, fervent wish was made real before my eyes. Our love was consecrated in the eyes of the heavens."{I knew this gift to us was to be used only one way. You are like Yezera: there’s one language you speak above all others."xI’ve been so selfish, using my words to express how wonderful you are. I should’ve been speaking your language."�Let me show you my love. Let me show you the sign I have received. Let our love be made immortal by this glorious omen, shining in the passions of combat."-Of course, my love. Make yourself ready."4I love you. Allow me to show you just how much."8...I won’t let you slip away. You’re mine, \PN."|You don’t understand what I mean yet. Let me show it to you. Let me open your eyes to the love you’ve been missing."BThis is meant to be. Witness the message the heavens gave me."�You’re making me wait. My heart is pounding. I can’t wait any longer. Will you now bear witness to this sign of our eternal love?"�Do you see it? The wish-bringer, come to grant me my wish! The light of our love shining through it! And you, like a star, like an avatar!"mI wanted Yezera, and I sought the avatars, all to lead me here. To woo a god, and make you mine forever."1Can’t you see? I will do anything for you."�I will move heaven and earth. I will love you eternally. I will smother you in compassion and affection. I will fill your life with comfort and pleasure."~I will steal for you. Kill for you. End this world for you, or remake it to be more pleasant for you. So long as you are mine."]So long as I can hold you, and love you, and know that you are mine and no one else’s."1I need help? That’s all you can say to me?"zI love you more than anyone has loved anything! Do you expect me to keep it inside, wear masks, be... civil about it?"It drives me to madness and back not embracing you here and now! As it should! Everyone else is blind not seeing your radiance!"pYou are gorgeous and brilliant and divine. What higher accomplishment could there be than to make you mine?">No one could aspire to anything better, except to be you."2I would for you. Don’t you understand that?"=Why would you reject me? I could make your life perfect!"�I would do anything for you, and you want to throw that away? Simply because I ask for your love in return? Am I not worthy of that, after everything?"RI am kind, and loving, and caring, and humble, and I can see your real worth!"VShouldn’t I be more worthy of love than anyone else? Do you think I’m insane?"You’re the mad one here if you think you’ll be better off without me. A beautiful mad god that refuses to be helped..."QNo! I will have you alone. I couldn’t stand to share you with anyone else!"cPlease, you won’t even notice. I will fill your days with joy. You won’t need anyone else."�If they ask for you, if they want you, I’ll take care of them. They can serve you – us – or they can leave. Our perfect days need no one else."~After all, I’m the only one that feels this raging love. I’m the only one that knows what you really are. Radiant. Divine."8Yes. Of course. Hah! Everything is as it should be."LThe entire world is falling into place, my love. You are mine. Forever."�Love, I’ve been working with Yezera to reset the world. I planned to rule with her, and then later I planned to make it a paradise for us two."�But now? You’re fighting Yezera, and I’ll gladly choose you over her. She’s nothing to me now. You’re the only one that matters."zHow about this? You go take care of her and make sure she never bothers us. Meanwhile, I’ll be making preparations."�I’ll make your life a dream. A beautiful, idyllic, paradisiacal dream from which you’ll never wake up. Go do what you do best."Oh, the plans I have. My love, just you wait. Please. Don’t hurry yourself. Although... you must have work to attend to."VOh, please, continue then. I wouldn’t dare take you away from what you do best."{I need time to prepare, and you need to wrap up these loose ends. Cut these threads away. You don’t need anyone else now."Y\PN, I’m going to make your life a dream. You’re a god... and now you’re mine."VWe’ll be together forever. Forever’s just beginning, and I’m a patient man."fSo go ahead. Get rid of Yezera. Get rid of everyone! And then come back to me, so I can hold you."QHere. Take Jirachi with you. A sign of my undying love, and our divine bond."OI love you, \PN. My gift to you is a god, because what else could suffice?"CTake it, and know you’re loved. Loved more than anyone else."7No? Oh, \PN, you don’t have to leave it with me."�If it isn’t good enough for you, I’ll make it up to you. Anything you desire, you’ll have. Just let me work out the details, alright?"SYou’re gorgeous. You’re perfect beyond words. And you’re mine. All mine."mSo go on. We can be apart for a little while more. I’ll be thinking of you every second you’re away."`I’ve got preparations to make. Time to set aside, items to procure, people to... obviate."[We’ll meet again. And then we’ll never meet again, because we’ll never be apart.">Goodbye, \PN. I love you more than anything in the world."The stone hums with power."TEtched into its side are two images, a pair of glowing spheres in red and blue.".You present the Red Orb and the Blue Orb."'The stone activates at your touch."9Are you also here to dance at the top of a mountain?"1I regret coming up here dressed like this..."0I wish Lainie were here to dance with me..."HYou won't dance with me? Well, I'm sure you're very fun at parties."=Go on, back to your climbing or whatever you like to do."Do you even have hobbies?"You’re leaving me? Why?"EI was going to create a perfect world for you. Do you know that?"�Yezera wants a new world. I don’t care why. It gave me the perfect canvas. An ancient, divine land. A golden age! And this time it’d never end!" I would have her... or you."�I served her whims here, helping her, fighting you, stealing the titans. And I would serve her in the reborn world, love her forever."�But now that you have shone upon me, I couldn’t ever go back to her. She pales in comparison. So now no one will receive this endless love."]I will never build a new world for my beloved. And I will never have a god to call mine."2...Fine. You’ll regret this. They all will."JThey’ll all die cold and alone, withering unloved and unremembered."dYou could’ve been happy. And now the fire smolders to embers and ash. I hope you choke on it."You – no!"QWhy would you give me hope just to rip it away? Why would you do this to me?"EI have worshiped you! I have loved you! I have always loved you!"iGods come to earth, turning their backs on me! Do I deserve this? Have I failed you in a single way?"0No! I am pure, and holy! My love is divine!"~Fine then! If you want to cast me into darkness, do so. If my love burns too brightly even for the heavens, cast me down."fYou can’t stop me. You can’t snuff me out. You’ll be mine eventually. One of the gods will."pAll I need is one to love forever. One to be mine, and mine alone. I won’t stop until I have one to keep."OI love you. I love you more than anything. And I’ll never see you again."�Maybe we’ll meet in another eternity, when I have a god of my own to love and care for. And then we’ll see if you regret this."OJirachi seems perturbed. It seems to have gravely misjudged the situation."WIt also seems apologetic. Perhaps it wants to make it up to you, or keep you safe."BMaybe it’s even attracted by your adamant hopes and wishes."7In any case, it seems willing to be caught by you."QHow Skyler was blessed by a mythical granter of wishes, you’ll never know."�Jirachi seems highly embarrassed and gladly lets itself be caught. Honestly, it seems like it just wants to forget this ever happened."nJirachi seems disappointed. You suspect it wanted to be caught and battle some more as a palate cleanser."ZAs an immortal being, though, it’s got plenty of time to forget this ever happened."\It leaves with the mountain wind. Perhaps you’ll see it again on these snowy peaks..."JThe true power of the Dragon-type is only unlocked during an Eclipse!"?The only problem here is my own. I have failed my Pokemon."FI shall return to my thoughts, and I will come back more focused."BDragon-type Pokemon often roost on the peak of this mountain."JHearing the songs of Hymnus is a true once-in-a- lifetime experience."Down: Gigalith's Guts"I want to talk."Not why I'm here."All I need is you."More gifts?"Let me prepare."Very well."...No?"You need help."Go to hell."Last bit's a dealbreaker."Yes. Let me be yours."Take Jirachi."Refuse Jirachi forever."Catch Jirachi."Release Jirachi forever.[�"nMi mamá me dijo que no venga aquí, pero realmente quería ver lo que es orinar al lado de una montaña."DYa no eh... tengo que orinar. Por ningún motivo en particular."yPensé que orinar en el punto más alto de Makya sería genial, pero no me estoy sintiendo tan liberado como pensé."QMe aterran las alturas, pero me aterra aún más crecer sin crear recuerdos."2Por eso elijo donde orinar con mucho cuidado."l¡\PN! ¡Mi amado! Las montañas enmarcan tu belleza en un modo que sólo puedo describir como sublime."PTe ves como si pudieras destrozarlas a tu alrededor y construirte un trono.";No tienes que hacerlo. Todo lo que necesitas es a mí."~Por supuesto. Siempre tengo tiempo para hablar contigo. Escuchar tu voz armoniosa hace que mis preocupaciones se disipen."2Podemos hablar de lo que sea. Cualquier cosa."P¿Por qué vendrías aquí si no es por mi? Podrías haberte quedado lejos."s¿Que te atrae a mí? Creo que ya sé lo que es. Ambos lo sabemos. Amaría mostrarte lo que realmente sientes."yEres perfecto. Veo todo mi amor reflejado en tus ojos. Es maravilloso. Quiero sostenerte como nada más en el mundo."*Oh, eres adorable. Tan pura criatura."tSí, mi amor. Siempre regalos. Te conseguiré lo que desees, siempre. Vales más que cualquier objeto material.""...Pero eso debe venir luego."_\PN. Tenía planeado proponerte matrimonio aquí. Pero luego fui bendecido por un milagro."}Mi deseo ferviente e inmortal fue hecho real delante de mis ojos. Nuestro amor fue consagrado en los ojos de los cielos."�Sabía que este regalo para nosotros fue para ser usado de sólo un modo. Tú eres como Yezera: hay un idioma que hablas sobre todos los demás."}He sido tan egoísta, usando mis palabras para expresar la maravilla que eres. Debería haber estado hablando tu idioma."�Déjame mostrarte mi amor. Déjame mostrarte la señal que he recibido. Deja que nuestro amor se haga inmortal por este glorioso augurio, brillando en las pasiones de un combate."'Por supuesto, mi amor. Prepárate."4Te amo. Sólo déjame mostrarte cuanto lo hago."5...No dejaré que te escabullas. Eres mío, \PN."}Aún no entiendes a lo que me refiero. Déjame mostrártelo. Déjame abrir tus ojos al amor que te has estado perdiendo."QEsto estaba predestinado. Atestigua el mensaje que me entregaron los cielos."�Me estás haciendo esperar. Mi corazón está latiendo. No puedo esperar más tiempo. ¿Vas a atestiguar ahora este símbolo de nuestro eterno amor?"�¿Lo ves? El hacedor de deseos, ¡Ha venido a concederme mi deseo! ¡La luz de nuestro amor brilla a través de él! Y de ti, como una estrella, ¡Como un avatar!"|Quería a Yezera, y deseaba a los avatares, y todo eso me trajo aquí. Para cortejar a un dios, y hacerte mío para siempre."5¿Acaso no lo ves? Haré cualquier cosa para ti."�Moveré el cielo y la tierra. Te moveré eternamente. Te asfixiaré en compasión y afecto. Llenaré tu vida con confort y placer."�Robaré para ti. Mataré para ti. Acabaré con este mundo para ti, o lo reharé para hacerlo más placentero para ti. Siempre y cuando seas mío."VSiempre y cuando pueda sostenerte, amarte, y saber que eres mío y de nadie más.";¿Necesito ayuda? ¿Eso es todo lo que puedes decirme?"�¡Te amo más de lo que nadie ha amado cualquier cosa! Acaso esperas que lo matenga dentro, ponerme máscaras, ¿Ser... civil al respecto?"�¡Me lleva a la locura no poder abrazarte aquí y ahora! ¡Como debería ser! ¡Todos los demás están ciegos por no ver tu resplandor!"fEres precioso y brillante y divino. ¿Qué logro más grande podría haber más que hacerte mío?"<Nadie podría aspirar a nada mejor, excepto que ser ti."4Lo que haría para ti. ¿Acaso no lo entiendes?"B¿Por qué me rechazarías? ¡Podría hacer tu vida perfecta!"�Haría lo que sea para ti, ¿Y quieres que lo tire a la basura? ¿Sólo porque te pido que me ames de vuelta? ¿No soy digno de eso, después de todo?"U¡Soy amable, y amoroso, y cariñoso, y modesto, Y puedo ver tu verdadero valor!"\¿No debería ser más digno que tu amor que nadie más? ¿Crees que estoy desquiciado?"oTú eres el loco aquí si crees que estarás mejor sin mi. Un hermoso dios loco que rechaza ser ayudado..."M¡No! Te tendré solo. ¡No podría soportar compartirte con nadie más!"fPor favor, ni siquiera lo notarás. Llenaré tus días de alegría. No necesitarás a nadie más."�Si preguntan por ti, si te quieren, me encargaré de ellos. Podrás servirte – a nosotros – o pueden irse. Nuestros días perfectos no necesitan a nadie más."Después de todo, soy el único que siente este amor intenso. Soy el único que conoce lo que realmente eres. Radiante. Divino."5Sí. Por supuesto. ¡Ja! Todo como debería ser."IEl mundo entero está formándose, mi amor. Eres mío. Para siempre."�Amor, he estado trabajando con Yezera para reiniciar el mundo. Planeaba gobernar con ella, y luego planeé hacerlo un paraíso para nosotros dos."�¿Pero ahora? Estás luchando contra Yezera, y con gusto te elegiré a ti sobre ella. Ella ahora no es nada para mi. Tú eres lo único que importa."�¿Qué tal esto? Ve a encargarte de ella y asegúrate que ella nunca nos moleste. Por mientras, estaré haciendo las preparaciones."�Haré a tu vida un sueño. Un maravilloso, idílico, paradisíaco sueño del cual nunca podrás despertar. Ve a hacer lo que mejor se te da."wOh, los planes que tengo. Mi amor, sólo espera. Por favor. No te apures. Aunque... debes tener trabajo que hacer."QOh, por favor, continúa. No me atrevería a quitarte lo que mejor se te da."Necesito tiempo para prepararme, y tú tienes que atar los cabos sueltos. Corta estos hilos. Ya no necesitas a nadie más."M\PN, voy a hacer a tu vida un sueño. Eres un dios... y ahora eres mío."^Estaremos juntos para siempre. Para siempre es sólo el inicio, y soy un hombre paciente."rAsí que continúa. Deshácete de Yezera. ¡Deshácete de todos! Y luego regresa a mi, así puedo sostenerte."bToma. Llévate a Jirachi contigo. Un signo de mi amor inmortal, y de nuestro vínculo divino."STe amo, \PN. Mi regalo para ti es un dios, ¿Qué más podría ser suficiente?"DTómalo, y sé que eres amado. Más que cualquier otra persona."2¿No? Oh, \PN, no tienes que dejarlo conmigo."�Si no es lo suficientemente bueno para ti, te lo compensaré. Lo que sea que desees, lo tendrás. Sólo déjame solucionar los detalles, ¿Está bien?"dEres hermoso. Eres más perfecto de lo que podría expresar con palabras. Eres mío. Todo mío."}Así que continúa. Podemos esta separados por sólo un poco más. Estaré pensando en ti cada segundo que estés lejos."bTengo preparaciones que hacer. Tiempo que apartar, objetos que procurar, gente que... obviar."gNos encontraremos de nuevo. Y luego no nos encontraremos nunca más, porque nunca nos separaremos."5Adiós, \PN. Te amo más que nada en este mundo."!La piedra resuena con poder."WGrabada en su lado hay dos imagenes, un par de esferas que brillan en rojo y azul."+Presentas el Orbe Rojo y el Orbe Azul."$La piedra se activa al tocarla."C¿También estás aquí para bailar en la cima de la montaña?"1Me arrepiento de venir aquí vestida así…"9Ojalá Lainie estuviera aquí para bailar conmigo..."R¿No bailarás conmigo? Bueno, seguramente seas muy divertido en las fiestas."AVe, de vuelta a tu escalada o lo que sea que te guste hacer."¿Siquiera tienes hobbies?"%¿Me estás dejando? ¿Por qué?"8Iba a crear un mundo perfecto para ti. ¿Sabes eso?"�Yezera quiero un nuevo mundo. No me importa por qué. Me dió el lienzo perfecto. Una tierra antigua, divina. ¡Una era dorada! ¡Y esta nunca terminaría!""La tendría a ella... o a ti."�Serví sus caprichos, ayudándola, combatiendo contra ti, robando los titanes. Y la serviría en el mundo renacido, amarla para siempre."�Pero ahora que brillaste para mi, no pude regresar a ella. Ella palidece en compración. Así que ahora nadie recibirá este amor inagotable."bNunca construiré un nuevo mundo para lo que amo. Y nunca tendré un dios al que llamar mío."8...Bien. Te arrepentirás de esto. Todos lo harán."XTodos morirán con frío y en soledad, marchitándose sin ser amados ni recordados."nPodrías haber estado feliz. Y ahora el fuego arde en ascuas y ceniza. Espero que te atragantes en estas."¡Tú – no!"X¿Por qué me darías esperanza sólo para quitármela? ¿Por qué me harías esto?"<¡Te he venerado! ¡Te he amado! ¡Siempre te he amado!"w¡Los dioses vienen a la tierra, sólo para darme la espalda! ¿Me merezco esto? ¿He fallado en todas las formas?"6¡No! ¡Soy puro, y sagrado! ¡Mi amor es divino!"�¡Muy bien! Si quieres arrojarme a la oscuridad, hazlo. Si mi amor alumbra de forma tan brillante hasta para los cielos, apartenme."fNada puede pararme. No pueden extinguirme. Serás mío eventualmente. Uno de los dioses lo será."yTodo lo que necesito es amar para siempre. Uno será mío, y solo mío. No pararé hasta que tenga uno que mantener."?Te amo. Te amo más que a nada. Y nunca te veré de nuevo."�Quizás nos encontraremos en otra eternidad, cuando mi propio dios que amar y cyudar. Y luego veremos como te arrepentirás de esto."KJirachi parece perturbado. Parece haber juzgado muy mal la situación."VTambién parece arrepentido. Quizás quiere compensártelo, o mantenerte a salvo."FQuizás incluso esta atraído por tus firmes esperanzas y deseos."EEn cualquier caso, parece estar dispuesto a ser atrapado por ti."TComo Skyler fue bendecido por un mítico otorgador de deseos, nunca lo sabrás."�Jirachi parece muy avergonazado y con gusto se deja ser atrapado. Honestamente, parece que sólo quiere olvidar que esto alguna vez ocurrió."tJirachi parece decepcionado. Sospechas que quería que ser atrapado y combatir un poco más como compensación."cPero, al ser un ser inmortal, tiene bastante tiempo para olvidar que esto alguna vez ocurrió."ZSe retira con el viento montañoso. Quizás lo verás de nuvo en estos picos nevados."W¡El verdadero poder de los tipo Dragón sólo es desbloqueado durante un Eclipse!"AEl único problema es el mío. Le he fallado a mis Pokémon."IDebo regresar a mis pensamientos, y volveré mucho más concentrado."QLos Pokémon de tipo Dragón suelen descansar en la cumbre de esta montaña."aEscuchar las canciones de un Hymnus es verdaderamente una experiencia de una vez en la vida."Debajo: Tripas de Gigalith"Quiero hablar.""No es por lo que estoy aquí."#Todo lo que necesito es a tí."¿Más regalos?"Déjame prepararme."Muy bien."¿...No?"Necesitas ayuda."Vete al infierno."$Lo último como que lo arruina."Sí. Déjame ser tuyo."Tomar a Jirachi."%Rechazar a Jirachi para siempre."Atrapar a Jirachi."$Liberar a Jirachi para siempre.;[�"wMy mom told me not to come up here, but I really wanted to see what it was like to pee off the side of a mountain.";I uh... don't need to pee anymore. For no real reason."{I felt like peeing off Makya's highest point would be great, but I'm not feeling as liberated as I thought I would be."WI'm scared of heights, but I'm more scared of growing old without making memories."4That's why I choose where I pee very carefully."^\PN! My beloved! The mountains frame your beauty in a way I can only describe as sublime."TYou look as if you could tear them down around you and build yourself a throne."-You don’t need to. All you need is me."oOf course. I always have time to talk with you. Listening to your dulcet voice makes my worries dissipate."1We can talk about anything. Anything at all."GWhy would you come here if not for me? You could’ve stayed away."sWhat draws you to me? You know what it is, I think. We both know. I’d love to show you what you really feel."oYou’re perfect. I see all my love reflected in your eyes. It’s beautiful. I want to hold you so badly."1Oh, you’re adorable. Such a pure creature."zYes, my love. Always gifts. I’ll get you anything you desire, always. You’re worth more than any material object."!...But that must come later."P\PN. I had planned to propose to you here. But then I was gifted a miracle."pMy undying, fervent wish was made real before my eyes. Our love was consecrated in the eyes of the heavens."{I knew this gift to us was to be used only one way. You are like Yezera: there’s one language you speak above all others."xI’ve been so selfish, using my words to express how wonderful you are. I should’ve been speaking your language."�Let me show you my love. Let me show you the sign I have received. Let our love be made immortal by this glorious omen, shining in the passions of combat."-Of course, my love. Make yourself ready."4I love you. Allow me to show you just how much."8...I won’t let you slip away. You’re mine, \PN."|You don’t understand what I mean yet. Let me show it to you. Let me open your eyes to the love you’ve been missing."BThis is meant to be. Witness the message the heavens gave me."�You’re making me wait. My heart is pounding. I can’t wait any longer. Will you now bear witness to this sign of our eternal love?"�Do you see it? The wish-bringer, come to grant me my wish! The light of our love shining through it! And you, like a star, like an avatar!"mI wanted Yezera, and I sought the avatars, all to lead me here. To woo a god, and make you mine forever."1Can’t you see? I will do anything for you."�I will move heaven and earth. I will love you eternally. I will smother you in compassion and affection. I will fill your life with comfort and pleasure."~I will steal for you. Kill for you. End this world for you, or remake it to be more pleasant for you. So long as you are mine."]So long as I can hold you, and love you, and know that you are mine and no one else’s."1I need help? That’s all you can say to me?"zI love you more than anyone has loved anything! Do you expect me to keep it inside, wear masks, be... civil about it?"It drives me to madness and back not embracing you here and now! As it should! Everyone else is blind not seeing your radiance!"pYou are gorgeous and brilliant and divine. What higher accomplishment could there be than to make you mine?">No one could aspire to anything better, except to be you."2I would for you. Don’t you understand that?"=Why would you reject me? I could make your life perfect!"�I would do anything for you, and you want to throw that away? Simply because I ask for your love in return? Am I not worthy of that, after everything?"RI am kind, and loving, and caring, and humble, and I can see your real worth!"VShouldn’t I be more worthy of love than anyone else? Do you think I’m insane?"You’re the mad one here if you think you’ll be better off without me. A beautiful mad god that refuses to be helped..."QNo! I will have you alone. I couldn’t stand to share you with anyone else!"cPlease, you won’t even notice. I will fill your days with joy. You won’t need anyone else."�If they ask for you, if they want you, I’ll take care of them. They can serve you – us – or they can leave. Our perfect days need no one else."~After all, I’m the only one that feels this raging love. I’m the only one that knows what you really are. Radiant. Divine."8Yes. Of course. Hah! Everything is as it should be."LThe entire world is falling into place, my love. You are mine. Forever."�Love, I’ve been working with Yezera to reset the world. I planned to rule with her, and then later I planned to make it a paradise for us two."�But now? You’re fighting Yezera, and I’ll gladly choose you over her. She’s nothing to me now. You’re the only one that matters."zHow about this? You go take care of her and make sure she never bothers us. Meanwhile, I’ll be making preparations."�I’ll make your life a dream. A beautiful, idyllic, paradisiacal dream from which you’ll never wake up. Go do what you do best."Oh, the plans I have. My love, just you wait. Please. Don’t hurry yourself. Although... you must have work to attend to."VOh, please, continue then. I wouldn’t dare take you away from what you do best."{I need time to prepare, and you need to wrap up these loose ends. Cut these threads away. You don’t need anyone else now."Y\PN, I’m going to make your life a dream. You’re a god... and now you’re mine."VWe’ll be together forever. Forever’s just beginning, and I’m a patient man."fSo go ahead. Get rid of Yezera. Get rid of everyone! And then come back to me, so I can hold you."QHere. Take Jirachi with you. A sign of my undying love, and our divine bond."OI love you, \PN. My gift to you is a god, because what else could suffice?"CTake it, and know you’re loved. Loved more than anyone else."7No? Oh, \PN, you don’t have to leave it with me."�If it isn’t good enough for you, I’ll make it up to you. Anything you desire, you’ll have. Just let me work out the details, alright?"SYou’re gorgeous. You’re perfect beyond words. And you’re mine. All mine."mSo go on. We can be apart for a little while more. I’ll be thinking of you every second you’re away."`I’ve got preparations to make. Time to set aside, items to procure, people to... obviate."[We’ll meet again. And then we’ll never meet again, because we’ll never be apart.">Goodbye, \PN. I love you more than anything in the world."The stone hums with power."TEtched into its side are two images, a pair of glowing spheres in red and blue.".You present the Red Orb and the Blue Orb."'The stone activates at your touch."9Are you also here to dance at the top of a mountain?"1I regret coming up here dressed like this..."0I wish Lainie were here to dance with me..."HYou won't dance with me? Well, I'm sure you're very fun at parties."=Go on, back to your climbing or whatever you like to do."Do you even have hobbies?"You’re leaving me? Why?"EI was going to create a perfect world for you. Do you know that?"�Yezera wants a new world. I don’t care why. It gave me the perfect canvas. An ancient, divine land. A golden age! And this time it’d never end!" I would have her... or you."�I served her whims here, helping her, fighting you, stealing the titans. And I would serve her in the reborn world, love her forever."�But now that you have shone upon me, I couldn’t ever go back to her. She pales in comparison. So now no one will receive this endless love."]I will never build a new world for my beloved. And I will never have a god to call mine."2...Fine. You’ll regret this. They all will."JThey’ll all die cold and alone, withering unloved and unremembered."dYou could’ve been happy. And now the fire smolders to embers and ash. I hope you choke on it."You – no!"QWhy would you give me hope just to rip it away? Why would you do this to me?"EI have worshiped you! I have loved you! I have always loved you!"iGods come to earth, turning their backs on me! Do I deserve this? Have I failed you in a single way?"0No! I am pure, and holy! My love is divine!"~Fine then! If you want to cast me into darkness, do so. If my love burns too brightly even for the heavens, cast me down."fYou can’t stop me. You can’t snuff me out. You’ll be mine eventually. One of the gods will."pAll I need is one to love forever. One to be mine, and mine alone. I won’t stop until I have one to keep."OI love you. I love you more than anything. And I’ll never see you again."�Maybe we’ll meet in another eternity, when I have a god of my own to love and care for. And then we’ll see if you regret this."OJirachi seems perturbed. It seems to have gravely misjudged the situation."WIt also seems apologetic. Perhaps it wants to make it up to you, or keep you safe."BMaybe it’s even attracted by your adamant hopes and wishes."7In any case, it seems willing to be caught by you."QHow Skyler was blessed by a mythical granter of wishes, you’ll never know."�Jirachi seems highly embarrassed and gladly lets itself be caught. Honestly, it seems like it just wants to forget this ever happened."nJirachi seems disappointed. You suspect it wanted to be caught and battle some more as a palate cleanser."ZAs an immortal being, though, it’s got plenty of time to forget this ever happened."\It leaves with the mountain wind. Perhaps you’ll see it again on these snowy peaks..."JThe true power of the Dragon-type is only unlocked during an Eclipse!"?The only problem here is my own. I have failed my Pokemon."FI shall return to my thoughts, and I will come back more focused."BDragon-type Pokemon often roost on the peak of this mountain."JHearing the songs of Hymnus is a true once-in-a- lifetime experience."Down: Gigalith's Guts"I want to talk."Not why I'm here."All I need is you."More gifts?"Let me prepare."Very well."...No?"You need help."Go to hell."Last bit's a dealbreaker."Yes. Let me be yours."Take Jirachi."Refuse Jirachi forever."Catch Jirachi."Release Jirachi forever.Iu;␀�"[[R"North: Sewer Junction"8North-East: Exit to Eleig Stretch Sewer Maintenance"&South: Exit to LuxTech Rec Center""South: Exit to LuxTech Campus"5How d’ya do? Can’t beat the stench out here."USinuses ain’t stung this bad since that shot of Reuniclus liquid came back up."XAh, I don’t get paid to complain, though. This Trubbish is bein’ real stubborn."5Mind lendin’ a hand? The way folks like us do?"=I’m a trainer. Real trainer, too – I train, y’see."]Train people’s Pokémon for money. We had a scuffle back in Novo Town… which ya won."RIf ya wanna know more than that, shame. We got a business relationship, yeah?"Now give me that rematch."Tch. Cold."iWelp, I’ll just park my ass here till this sack o’ trash works up the nerve to get its feet wet."'Get that toxin pumpin’, ya know?"AYou’re one of them reliable sorts, ain’tcha? Disgusting."KAh, I kid, I kid! Nice to see a little innocence ‘round these parts.",Now c’mon, show me your vicious side."<Got a bin liner to train and nobody to keep me company."Mind lendin’ a hand?"IAh, I kid, I kid! Nice to see a little innocence 'round these parts."-Ya see that? I knew you had a mean side."XDownright sadistic. Always good to have a bit o’ your inner psychopath available."EReal ace up your sleeve kinda deal, y’see what I’m sayin’?"@Babyface like you got plenty of room to blindside somebody."<Love to see it happen, love to see ya take it to heart."'You’re a hero. Look at yourself."GBut don’t get pinned down by the role – have some fun with it."+Play the rival a bit, yeah? Be a heel."VAh, nevermind me. Maybe you’re better at playing the hero, through and through."@Me? I’m a rival. I ain’t your rival, but I was a rival."YI wasn’t ever meant for big things, ya know? But I help keep heroes on their toes."MAnd, hell, maybe I have some fun along the way. Make some friends, yeah?"BThose days are behind me, but ya can’t teach me new tricks."9Fightin’ you feels like old times. I 'preciate it."/The name’s <imp>Alessa</imp>, by the by."I'Fraid I can’t chat any longer, though. I’m off to the big city."ASome bigshot CEO’s kid needs his reserves trained up ASAP."7Speakin' of trainin', ya should have one of these."QI'm sure it'll come in handy, if ya keep roughin' it in sewers and the like."9Anywho, see ya 'round. Don’tcha keep me waitin’."CIt is always important to give back from where you have taken!"uMy friend and I have been feeding the Munchlax down here as thanks for providing us with important battle items."jWe've done our part, but perhaps you would like to join us? The Pokemon down here love Big Malasadas."dIf you could get a batch of ten from the LuxTech food vendor, we could do a little bit of good."DThat is alright Trainer, my friend and I have more than enough."LBut consider my offer! It is not about wealth, it is about reciprocity."?Fantastic! The Pokemon here will appreciate your kindness!"GI don't see enough for a batch, Trainer. Perhaps you are mistaken."`Big Malasadas are sold at the LuxTech Campus. You should be able to purchase a batch there."MIt would be foolish of me to talk about reciprocity and not reciprocate!"5Here, Trainer. It is not much, but it is a gift."KEnjoy the world, Trainer. It is there for us, and we are there for it."@These Pokemon are happy as a direct result of your actions."BNot every Pokemon will have a grand adventure with a Trainer."IIt is important to remember that those Pokemon matter just the same."aYou know, I feel a little bad about stealing all those Nuggets from the Pokemon down here..."KIt reeks down here, but the Pokemon in this place are pretty friendly."VThey're more used to human contact than most, given how these are sewers and all.",You're a LuxTech employee, aren't you?!"I'm gonna steal your TMs!".Silver Ninjask isn't going to be happy...";Now this job's gone completely sideways. Thanks a lot."bYou better watch your back when you walk away or I might snatch those TMs from you after all.",I don't think I'm at the right river..."AI guess I'm gonna go for a swim... Please close your eyes..."3This place doesn't look fun to swim through..."!Can I borrow your surfboard?"No? Ok..."Who are you?"	Nah."
