op? Get out of my trash.""0You decide not to fish around in the trash.",*hiss* So that’s that. Bit of a mess."YBut you’ve got a real knack for handling chaos, huh? You remind me of… whatever."9Zoé! Show some respect to the future champion, huh?"3Take the badge, my friend: you’ve earned it."+You were UNTOUCHABLE; just incredible!"6And Zoé’s wrong. We don’t need to watch you."+You’re the one we were told to find."iUh, as much as I hate to say it, I’ve gotta let Zoé take care of this one. She knows what to say."Not right now."Hell yeah."Give me a sec."Yeah, I do."Yes"NoIu;␀i[["0My family has trained here for generations."QI've seen a few like you in my life. Always a thrilling experience to fight."}This place always always seems to draw in those on great journeys. I take advantage of that to watch history first-hand."GI have had the pleasure of battling every champion in this region."KI've lost everytime, but each is an unforgettable learning experience."=They say each drop of light carries a memory of triumph."rMemories adrift, floating dreams. An aspiration fulfilled, yet peace sickens them. Do you find yourself here?"6Perhaps your victories will end up here, one day."?Spend enough time here and it begins to feel like a forum.["8Mi familia ha entrenado aquí durante generaciones."SHe visto a varios como tú en mi vida. Siempre es una experiencia emocionante."{Este lugar siempre parece atraer a aquellos en grandes periblos. Me aprovecho de ello para ver la historia en primera fila."BTuve el gusto de enfrentarme a cada campeón de esta región."RPerdí en todas las ocasiones, pero cada una fue una experiencia inolvidable."?Dicen que cada gota de luz lleva la memoria de un triunfo."�Memorias a la deriva, sueños flotantes. Una aspiración realizada, pero la paz los contamina. ¿Te encuentras a ti mismo aquí?":Quizás tus victorias terminarán aquí, algún día."DPasa suficiente tiempo aquí y empieza a sentirse como un foro.;["0My family has trained here for genera