eeded by the Estate Caretaker.Iu;␀�[["FA small feeding bowl, refilled as needed by the Estate Caretaker.["^Un pequeño bowl de alimentación, rellenado apropiadamente por la Cuidadora del Terreno.;["FA small feeding bowl, refilled as needed by the Estate Caretaker.Iu;␀�[["FA small feeding bowl, refilled as needed by the Estate Caretaker.["^Un pequeño bowl de alimentación, rellenado apropiadamente por la Cuidadora del Terreno.;["FA small feeding bowl, refilled as needed by the Estate Caretaker.Iu;␀�{[[,"Aquatopia"Oh. \PN."Seeking truth, as ever."LI cannot tolerate introspection, so extrospection will have to suffice."MThe real one! The one that snaps at you if you say something so uncouth."cThe fake Imogene tries to ingratiate herself through saccharine kindness. Such as that amulet."AAh! Assist me – tolerate me – a while longer, would you?"uYou’re already in my grasp, and I am not afraid to bribe you to keep you there. I come bearing gifts, you see."QBut, to reach something resembling a point, I am here to reach a revelation."uLook at this city: a sprawling blight. How many habitats, nests, spawning grounds were all stamped out for this?"0A concrete atrocity, paving over the world."<…Perhaps. Pokémon have made their warrens here, too."WThe old died out that the new might live. Not so much erasure, then, but rather…"oIndeed they do. Life has not been extinguished like a match ground underfoot. It has simply undergone a…"ZI lived a great many years in a single-story nest of wood. It was comfortable enough."KAnd yet everywhere I wander I find more wilderness gone. A creeping…"Agree with what?"lWith me? I am not so sure I agree with myself. After all, life thrives here, albeit in different forms."*Evolution? Devolution? Certainly a…"Transformation."TAnd so I find myself here. The wild and untamed has shapeshifted into humanity."2That is what a city is, yes? The human biome?"�So what can I learn from all this? Is this what I am? An expression 