ernate forms."9Despite the name, it doesn’t apply to all Pokemon."[Just ones that can change outside of battle. Rotom, Deerling, Burmy,... some others..."WI hope you enjoyed it, because that’s the last spiel you’re gonna get from me."iThere’s a job that needs doing in the world’s weirdest cave… and I’m the person for the job."I have to be."QThat being said... where has Michi gone off to? She was here a moment ago..."7There you are! Come on Michi, we have a job to do.";Aquatopia offers ocean fishing trips and competitions."2They're the best fishing experience in Makya!"@Local legend has it that these stone pillars are quite old."mBence claims that they were here before plans to construct Prizca West, let alone specifically this gym."SMakya does have its fair share of strange rock formations, I'll give you that."{But Chasm members could talk about Pikachu being an Electric-type and I'd still pull out my MasterDex to double check."Hey! \PN!"Over here!"5Candy grabs you and pulls you towards the bench."'\PN! I need some help, like, ASAP.";I’ve – wow, I’m out of breath, give me a second."Damn. OK, I’m good."I mean, I’m not good."5I’ve got, like, a total manhunt going on here."pYou’re, like, super-awesome at dueling, right? So – wait, total lightbulb moment. Genius plan incoming."[OK c’mon you really definitely gotta help me out like I’ll give you half the loot?"8You wouldn’t leave me out here, right? By myself?"HNah, you’re cool. You’re a cool person. You’re gonna help me."'I maybe sorta committed a robbery."And breaking and entering."And arson."But it was an accident!"kOK, just the arson was accidental. But I swear I didn’t rob anyone that didn’t totally deserve it." So shut up and help me, OK?";What I’m gonna need you to do is give me some cover."9Duel me? Like, so they just see a fight and move on?"PY’know, like in a movie when they kiss so the bad guys get all flustered?"pI figured you’d be more into, like, fighting me than kissing me. Especially if I, like, healed your team."Y’know. No offense!".Yeah! I knew you’d come through for me!"DReady to see what a real hero fights like? Lead us off, Jeanne!"Wow. I guess that worked."_And you – you’re, like, yep. Totally A+. S+, if you want to be, y’know, kinda extra." Which I am. Kinda cringe…"
