ity."?This island will be gone. There are some that refute that."pSometimes, there is value in fighting the inevitable. Sometimes. I am never sure about it until it is over."QThere are those who try to preserve this place, as foolish as that might be."TI wonder how it will end up for them. It is a good trial, and a proper funeral."mBut that is them. I should focus on myself. I am ready for challenge. Are you ready for battle, Trainer?"Excellent!"ANow is the time! Let us break and reform from our struggles!"%And you lay before me in pieces."bThere's only one direction to go from here. Regain youself, and try again. You can do better.">Very well, but do not leave me waiting. I abhor idleness."OI am looking for one last trial myself. Are you ready for battle, Trainer?"4Wonderful! It was about time for me to shatter!"lI revel in that sting you get when you know you've been outmatched! It is undeniable, how jealous I am!">But such a feeling is fleeting, for better and for worse."TIt's time for me to get ready for the next hill. I'll be inside if you need me.";These Guardians have been here since before all of us."9If there is a way forward, they will bring us there."/You have snuffed out any hope that we had."1I'm not sure that it was a good or bad deed."(We seek its power to heal our home."!Now all we can do is wait..."You must have a plan!"0Centuries of guidance cannot end like this!"VSo many here wish to give up our homeland. To what! Simple time and happenstance?"UI will depart, but I will be bitter. The spirit of our island will sink with it."LI am surrounded by fools! The sages are right! We must adapt or perish!"Leave me be, outsider."LMy Rampardos and I have a unique camaraderie. We suffer from hair loss."4I need to get a sick crown like my Rampardos..."5I must treat the little hair I have left kindly."#Mmm. Maybe I should buy a hat."eHon hon! This island has exceptional beauty! It is a shame I will be the last visitor to see it."TOh, are you also foreign to here? Well, that ruins the title of "last visitor"."1Ah, the locals here are so good at battling."/I think I'll enjoy a fine Kalosian wine..."ZLook towards the future, Trainer. You might miss how much of a mess the past becomes."2Come, my Pokemon. Let us take a final stroll."0It's a shame how the past has been tainted."IWe are old minded here. But our ways are nothing in front of nature."aWe like to forget that we are still a part of nature, no matter how high we build ourselves."Winning the Championship."Helping a friend."!Telling someone to buzz off."Letting go of my past."	Yes."Not right now."Yes, when I lost someone." Yes, when I failed someone."Yes, when I upset someone."No, I haven't felt that."Yes, to help someone."Yes, to gain something."Yes, to avoid my fears."No, I haven't.Iu;␀�[[$"	\PN."3Thank you for listening to me and coming here."	\PN!",Are you sure you aren’t Psychic-type?"jI spent the last day mulling over whether to call you, and here you are, arriving of your own accord."<…I’m glad to see you, even if part of me isn’t…"#Let’s get right to business."@You probably figured this out already, but I’m ex- Chasm."eA few years ago I joined an expedition into the Circuit Cave organized by the Makyan Government."TOur goal: to understand the circuitry and machinery housed in the lower layers."rAs it turns out, being the only engineer in a throng of useless academics makes it hard to get anything done."~Who cares about “cultural significance” or “hydrological processes" when we don’t even know what the thing does?!"*…but that’s all in the past, now."AI brought you here because of a different group of ex-Chasm."The Drillers.""What a lovely bunch they are."hThey’re basically a gang wearing ranger uniforms— and this corner of Makya is their “turf”."dUsually we’re keen to avoid the Regi Tombs, but recent events have… got some of us nervous."`That’s what the Drillers are saying, anyways… that they’re here to protect the place."Keep the prisons secure.",I think that’s a load of Tauros dung."FAnd even if it’s not, I don’t trust them around the machines."~So, my request: Figure out what The Drillers are doing. And stop them, if my instincts about their mission prove correct."#Finish the job that I can’t."!I’ll stand watch out here.";Need a refresher? I know, it’s a lot of information."0The Drillers have invaded the Oasis System."?They’re a bunch of brutes, and probably up to something."HEven if they’re not, I don’t want them anywhere near the place."}I’ll never figure out why the ancients built this System if The Drillers find a way to “accidentally” destroy it first."BIn short: find The Drillers and—if neccessary—evict them.[$"	\PN."*Gracias por escucharme y venir aquí."¡\PN!"3¿Estás seguro que no eres de tipo Psíquico?"iPasé el último día reflexionando si debía llamarte o no, y aquí estás, llegando por tu cuenta."?…Me alegra verte, incluso si parte de mí no lo está..."Vayamos al tiro."JProbablemente ya te diste cuenta a este punto, pero sou un ex- Chasm."gHace unos años me uní a una expedición a la Cueva Circuito organizada por el Gobierno de Makya."bNuestro objetivo: entender los circuitos y la maquinaría encontrada en las capas inferiores."Y resulta que ser el único ingeniero en una multitud de académicos inútiles hace que sea difícil hacer cualquier cosa."|¡¿A quién le importa el "significado cultural" o los "procesos hidrológicos" cuando ni siquiera sabemos qué hace?!"/…pero todo eso ahora está en el pasado."6Te traje aquí por un grupo distinto de ex-Chasm."Los Excavadores."%Un grupo de lo más encantandor."mSon básicamente una banda que lleva uniformes de rangers— y este rincón de Makya es su "territorio"."~Usualmente evitamos las Tumbas Regis, pero eventos recientes han hecho que... algunos de nosotros nos pongamos nerviosos."lO eso es lo que los Excavadores están diciendo, al menos... que están aquí para proteger este lugar."Proteger las prisiones."&Y yo pienso que eso son sandeces."IE incluso si 