ome an honorary Bibarel!"aWhoa! That last move almost smashed the whole dam! I'll get right back to work fixing it up!"aAnother day, another trainer recklessly battled on this new dam. My Pokemon love the thrill!"?This is such a nice spot, I should bring a couch out here."kUsed to look a little more pretty before the Biberal cut down the trees, but I appreciate the company."Um... hey."9So, Tamarind and I, like, kissed and made up? Kinda?"GUm, not in that way. She’s like twenty-five years older than me."@I... \PN, I still really hate her. She is, like, the worst."�She’s this snooty arrogant brat that literally destroys things that get in her way for no reason. But, like, I can’t just punch her and make it better."...But I did punch her."ENot really! It was kind of a wimpy punch. Still, I had to do it."For baby Candy, at least."#I know, I know! It was stupid."VBut, like, I’ve thought about it so many times, and now I finally got to do it."LIt didn’t make me happy, but I can scratch it off the list, y’know?"DOh, not even. She deserves to be punched, like, at least twice."6What? That punching her doesn’t make it better?"hOr that I, like, decked her in the first place? Because the answer is yeah, I’m a learning Candy."HReally, I let her off easy. But, um, I didn’t really let her off."sI kinda... got hired? Like, I do not trust that hag for a second, so I’m gonna stick to her like a Remoraid."OShe’s gonna fix all the messed-up stuff that she and her cronies caused."OAnd she’s, like, totally overworked, so, um... yeah. I’m her aide now!"#And bodyguard. And conscience."WI get to get justice, and she gets to not have her labs be on fire. Everyone wins."@Heh… thanks. I’m, like, not sure of anything right now."VWho knows! Maybe I’ll think better of it tomorrow and firebomb her lab anyways!")Hey! What’s that supposed to mean?"UDo you think I’m just, like, this belligerent ditzy manic Spritzee dream girl?"]No, but, yeah, I get it. I don’t know that I’m, like, super cut out f