ill prosper for as long as the city stands.""*"May it last for another 3500 years!""7"Prizca, where the future is built with the past.""GA poster for an upcoming show. A notice says it's almost sold out!"7Next to it is a calendar of other upcoming events."1Prizca Castle predates even the city itself.";Some historians say it could be almost 4000 years old!"+The cityscape here always inspires me."=The shapes, the colors, the fashion, it's all wonderful."EIt's an artist's paradise, I can see why Noel sets up shop here."2I saw a famous singer appear out of thin air."8Right in front of that clay statue near the castle."JI tried reporting it to the rangers, but they all just laughed at me."I know what I saw!"TJust because I can't remember his name doesn't mean you shouldn't believe me..."Skeevy Eevee Pub"Prizca's East Gym"Leader: Noel"Sculptor, Battler, Artist."-A lineup for an upcoming music festival."UElectrique!, Mandibles of the Land, OHKO Queen, HippowDon't... it's a long list."6Museum-quality artifacts behind shiny metal bars."%I'll take your Pokémon for a --"..."BWow, you have no idea how easy it is to slip into that habit."DI'm just here to have a smoke before I have to go back to work."=The cafe inside is pretty nice, you should check it out."!Their coffee is pretty good."Bit pricey though."("Best bang for your buck in Makya!""@I used to be Chasm, but now I work at the Capitol Building."]Got myself a nice office and everything. A pretty decent setup for being a former grunt."uI mean, mostly everyone got off alright. Helena made sure everyone at least had a job before the Team disbanded."JI wonder what my former squadmates are doing. I hope they're alright."Noel's House"5The shops on this side of town are quite quaint.">Lot of odds and ends, stuff you won't find anywhere else!"Ironclad Dojo"$Make yourself as tough as iron!"UThe West end of Prizca was constructed rapidly over the last thirty or so years."PNo time for beauty or community to form, it's all very lifeless over there."1This side of the city is much more charming."ENoel may be chill, but the trainers in his gym are anything but."pLording their position over challengers, making them run petty errands to 'earn' the 'right' to fight them."6Makes me sick that they can be so openly corrupt."8The Houndominus has its eyes locked on its trainer."3Y'know, \PN, I never thought to ask your name."yFigured it out on the way here when I did a quick li’l background check on my client up here, and then on you too."pGuess this breaks some kinda confidentiality rule, but I ain’t never been an honorable sort: it’s Zain."KYour big brother’s hired me, lookin’ to get his reserves in shape."[Keepin’ it cool. Gotta make sure it ain’t just bravado, though. Ya know how it is."lLotsa folks talk a big talk. It’s been a while since we last had a chat, so maybe ya lost your touch."Y'Fraid not. I ain't honorable, but I do what I do, and I do a mighty fine job of it.">I got paid, I got Pokémon, and you know what that means."*Oh, ya don’t have to tell me twice."}I figure lettin’ you have a crack at 'em gives you a neat little leg up in a way that’s still me doing my job, ya get it?"!So, ya got time for a match?"yI know, I know, I do it every time, but I got debts to pay. We can chat afterwards, if that’s what you’re after."Whaddya say?".I ain’t goin’ nowhere. Drop by, yeah?"8Well, let’s see what your brother’s got for ya."4Back for a li’l sneak peek? Ya damned rascal."9Well, ya took care of that well enough, didn’t ya?"LMaybe Zain’s better than I am. He’s going through gyms, ain’t he?"(I never did have the time for that."_I was working for Chasm back when Yezera and I were fightin’. Then they set up the gyms."YYezera got through 'em like nothin’, but at that point… I wasn’t feelin’ it."tDon’t feel like talkin’ about her too much, though. She’s got enough on her plate without me gossipin’."1Didn’t I just say I wasn’t gonna gossip?"QBut everybody knows it: she went missin’. Couldn’t handle the spotlight."bHell, could barely handle a conversation with most folks. Been like that since she was a tot."(Ya better respect your elders, kid."EI ain’t talked your ear off half as much as my grandpappy did."LYa know you don’t hafta come find me, yeah? I didn’t hunt you down."What, of Yezera’s?"%Best damn friend there ever was."JSure, I was a bully back then, but ain’t nobody bullied her but me."7We fought like Zangoose and Seviper, ya know that?"-But 'nuff said. I gotta get out of town."7Things are 'bout to get messy – I gotta feeling."=So if you end up in the thick of it, keep your guard up."U'Member: slow is smooth, smooth is fast. Make it out of that, then we’ll talk."^Catch ya at that <imp>volcano in Casaba</imp>, yeah? And take this. Better you than Zain."OI'm here to challenge the gym, but the people in there are just the worst."KI don't have enough money to buy all the stuff they're making me grab!"BMaybe I can scare one of them into giving me back my items..."Its nametag reads "Thor"."East End Exclusives"CI know, I know, it's a <i>dog</i> park, not a <i>cat</i> park."FBut my little menace has more energy than I know what to do with."I had to find an outlet!"TThis man doesn't notice you, he seems to be rambling to someone over the phone."5You don't see a phone though. Maybe an earpiece?"(Who's a good boy? Who's a good boy?"You are boy, you are!"DYo yo, if it ain't my favorite person to lose over and over to."2Just kidding. That's Aaron. He's very polite.";Back on topic: The gym here is pretty straightforward."wOnce I grabbed a Knight Helmet from Prizca Castle to evolve this Escavalier, I knew I was about 50% there already."hThough, I'm still a crazy perfectionist, so I want to battle for more practice, if you're up to it."ASo much culture here. Makes me want to say something poetic."(But, eh, let's just battle instead."Understood."+I'll be here until you wish to battle."CHAAAAAARGE!"eAaron would have found a way to compliment my battling just now