 are quite quaint.">Lot of odds and ends, stuff you won't find anywhere else!"Ironclad Dojo"$Make yourself as tough as iron!"UThe West end of Prizca was constructed rapidly over the last thirty or so years."PNo time for beauty or community to form, it's all very lifeless over there."1This side of the city is much more charming."ENoel may be chill, but the trainers in his gym are anything but."pLording their position over challengers, making them run petty errands to 'earn' the 'right' to fight them."6Makes me sick that they can be so openly corrupt."8The Houndominus has its eyes locked on its trainer."3Y'know, \PN, I never thought to ask your name."yFigured it out on the way here when I did a quick li’l background check on my client up here, and then on you too."pGuess this breaks some kinda confidentiality rule, but I ain’t never been an honorable sort: it’s Zain."KYour big brother’s hired me, lookin’ to get his reserves in shape."[Keepin’ it cool. Gotta make sure it ain’t just bravado, though. Ya know how it is."lLotsa folks talk a big talk. It’s been a while since we last had a chat, so maybe ya lost your touch."Y'Fraid not. I ain't honorable, but I do what I do, and I do a mighty fine job of it.">I got paid, I got Pokémon, and you know what that means."*Oh, ya don’t have to tell me twice."}I figure lettin’ you have a crack at 'em gives you a neat little leg up in a way that’s still me doing my job, ya get it?"!So, ya got time for a match?"yI know, I know, I do it every time, but I got debts to pay. We can chat afterwards, if that’s what you’re after."Whaddya say?".I ain’t goin’ nowhere. Drop by, yeah?"8Well, let’s see what your brother’s got for ya."4Back for a li’l sneak peek? Ya damned rascal."9Well, ya took care of that well enough, didn’t ya?"LMaybe Zain’s better than I am. He’s going through gyms, ain’t he?"(I never did have the time for that."_I was working for Chasm back when Yezera and I were fightin’. Then they set up the gyms."YYezera got through 'e