in."5You waiting for me to throw a Poké Ball at you?"RI’m not gonna. Not about to bruise my team just before challenging the gym."zYes, \PN. I snuck down here and put a sign on the door saying it’s closed after beating the gym, just to trick you."$It’s a flawless plan, really."$Not if you schedule in advance."]Or that’s what I’d like to say – professionalism isn’t in this region’s blood."HDon’t even get me STARTED on that man in the bayou. Insufferable."!In any case, Samorn’s out."]Sign on the door says she’s dealing with some ruckus over at the dig site. You coming?")That’s what I thought. Let’s go."COh, you want to be contrary, do you? Fine. Stay here and wait." The dig site. West of town."pI swear, sometimes you’re more thick-skulled than a Rampardos. Let’s go perform some heroics, shall we?"gThe railway here used to be pretty nice, but it got destroyed when that girl took Team Chasm down."cNo one's ever really gotten to repairing the whole thing, too much hassle for too little gain."LMost of the dirt and heavy equipment are already where they need to be."KClosed while Samorn participates in the Makya Championship Tournament."XHey, trying to get Samorn's badge as well? I've tried, but I've had no luck so far."UI was prepped for countering a Sandstorm strategy, based on the legends I heard."tBut she apparently hasn't used that strategy in forever, despite how well suited to it some of her Pokemon are."NMaybe it's a "hiding your true power level" thing? I just don't get it..."DYou got the 8th badge? Damn, that means I gotta get myself one.">I want to at least make it to the Championship this year."Um, hi?"You're acting different."Same to you."You're a creep."Wait, what?"Good for her."You're into Yezera?"Eyes only for me?"Um."Hell no."I feel the same way."Can we be friends?"Maybe later."Sure, let's go."You kidding me?"Happens a lot."Of course."	Nah."Where?0Iu;␀�)[[^"*Phione! \PN! What just happened here?"LWhat? They can do that? Like, Phione BECAME an avatar? That’s insane!"5I’ve been trying to find Phione for hours now!"LAnd then when I finally do it’s you fighting it as a fricking avatar?"UYeah! What’d you do? I mean – I’m not blaming you, but what happened here?"0OK, sorry, I get it. You’re confused too.">Phione was acting strange – standoffish, kinda hostile."LThen it lashed out at me and bolted. I’ve been hunting it since then."BIt looks OK now… you couldn’t’ve KO’d it any gentler?"kAh, it’s alright. No major scrapes or bruises – it’ll be fine. Just need to do some first aid…"I get that, but c’mon."XIt’s obviously – I don’t know, possessed or something. Messed up in the head.">It’s not too bruised. Just need to do some first aid…"*Well… yeah. Sure. It’s an avatar."XDon’t pull your punches. Well, no harm no foul. Just need to do some first aid…"VInsane. Complete insanity. It attacked me, turned into an avatar, attacked you…"8What would’ve happened if you hadn’t beaten it?"qAh, no use thinking about it. I just… I feel terrible. I feel just awful, because honestly I’m relieved."WBecause if it wasn’t an avatar, then it just left. It just left me. It hated me."MYeah. Because at least it didn’t really hate me. It didn’t leave me."nIt’s hard. I was so afraid that it’d just left me that anything else is, like, a breath of fresh air."ZWell… we’ll see. Hopefully it’ll wake up and this’ll all be a distant memory."(Something we can laugh about, yeah?"0And… damn, I keep bringing you into this?"6You gotta bail me outta everything. Well, thanks."gHere. I’ve had these for a while, but I don’t really need them now. For one reason or another."/Doesn’t really make us even, but thanks."UI need to get Phione somewhere safer, but I’ll see you. Thanks for everything."BHave you seen my new avatar defense technique? Pokésand, go!"0Hmm, back to the drawing board on this one."ZThe technique is for avatars, not Trainers. I can't expect it to work perfectly here."$Huh? Weather wars? What's that?"North: Cave of Hatching"East: Frostflow Farms"=Hey! It's uh... the guy you saw near the Regice Chamber."CI think I got a decent understanding of what's happened to me."XWhatever I was, it kept me separated from the world for a while. A lot has changed."BTeam Chasm is done. People have moved on, though not totally."�Rangers got me set up good. I have a lot of old friends that thought I was dead. They were more than happy to help me when I showed up."�In a way, Hoopa really did help me. Got to skip out on some of the rough parts of Team Chasm breaking up, and I'm taken care of."nI'm... ok. In a weird way. But that's life for ya, huh? It's all weird, and then it isn't. And you're ok."'That's life. Weird, but you're ok."%That's a nice feeling, you know?"�How are you... here? This isn't even the right map... I don't actually exist. Sort of, at least... Please... don't cheat when we fight..."FSheeeeeeesh, let's get a looksie at this this little Trainer now!"YWell butter my butt and call me a biscuit, this here Trainer's got us slapped silly!"eWhat a howdown from our Trainer friend here. Bet they got one o' those fancy candy thingamajigs."Stop that"CA Pokemon world, and within every battle, a world of struggle."CHow much can I fit, into a haiku format? I'm running out of..."JA loud crashing lake, Chatot chirp in the distance, they sing united."FI write, erase, rewrite. Erase again, and then, my Ditto changes."QYou can barely make out the outline of a cave entrance behind the waterfall."BMy Pokemon love the trees and grass. They also love battling!"8What's that, my Pokemon? You want to go to the pub?"6I have no choice, I must listen to them. Bye bye!"_Good battling! You should fight my brother, too. He's all the way at the end of the river."Heya, Trainer!"LI heard that a Champion was going to be here, but I couldn't find them."nI even brought a Krabby to throw at them and everything! I stole it from a Ranger when he wasn't looking."RIf I can't throw it at someone important, I'll sell it to get some ice cream!"0$5000! That'll get me ice cream for a week!"AYou're lucky you're a nobody, otherwise I'd throw it at you."Done deal Trainer!"&\PN hands over $5000 in exchange."&Maybe I'll get chocolate today...",Haha, you're poor! That's really funny!"TWell golly me we got a cheater! Looks like they did a little bit of hackerooni."mWell I ain't never seen a scrap like that since before my pa started herding Tauros with his bare hands."3Real shame what happened to his favorite knee."<Welp, I'll have to abandon my Cave of Hatching visit..."LThe entrance is blocked, and I stupidly didn't bring any climbing gear."5If I did, I could have climbed around, but alas."1All I wanted was to experience the legend..."4Take this item, I'm clearly not worthy of it..."..."You're cheating, right?"EI'm just here to play my guitar. No idea who the other guy is..."It was an avatar."You're here?"You're asking me?"Sorry."It was attacking me."Could've. Didn't."	Why?"That it was possessed?"Don't beat yourself up."No thanks."I'll take it.[^",¡Phione! ¡\PN! ¿Qué acaba de pasar?"\¿Qué? ¿Pueden hacer eso? Osea, ¿Phione se CONVIRTIÓ en un avatar? ¡Eso es insano!"-¡He estado buscando a Phione por horas!"V¿Y cuando finalmente lo hago está combatiendo contra ti como un maldito avatar?"X¡Sí! ¿Que harías tu? Osea – no te estoy culpando, ¿Pero qué ocurrió aquí?"4Ok, perdón, entiendo. También estás confuso."?Phione estaba actuando extraño – distante, algo hostil."DLuego me atacó y salió huyendo. Lo he buscado desde entonces."SAhora parece estar bien… ¿No podrías haberlo tumbado de forma más gentil?"sAh, está bien. Ninguna herida mayor – estará bien. Sólo tendré que hacer un poco de primeros auxilios…"Lo entiendo, pero vamos."MEstá obviamente – no sé, poseído o algo. Algo le pasa en su cabeza."ZNo está demasiado lastimado. Sólo tendré que hacer un poco de primeros auxilios…"(Bueno… sí. Seguro. Es un avatar."}No te andes con chiquitas. Bueno, si no hay daño no hay maldad. Sólo tendré que hacer un poco de primeros auxilios…"TInsano. Insanidad absoluta. Me atacó, se convirtió en un avatar, te atacó…"5¿Qué habría pasado si no lo hubieras vencido?"~Ah, no vale la pena pensar sobre ello. Yo sólo… me siento terrible. Me siento terrible, porque honestamente estoy aliviado."TPorque si no era un avatar, entonces sólo me dejó. Sólo me dejó. Me odiaba."=Seh. Porque entonces al menos no me odiaba. No me dejó."vEs díficil. Tenía tanto miedo de que me dejaría que cualquier otra cosa es, como, una bocanada de aire fresco."[Bueno… ya veremos. Con suerte se despertará y todo esto será una memoria distante.",¿Algo de lo que nos podemos reír, eh?"8Y… maldita sea, ¿Continúo arrastrandote a esto?"/Vas a rescatarme de todas. Bueno, gracias."_Ten. He tenido estas por un tiempo, pero realmente no las necesito. Por una razón u otra."/No nos llega a poner a mano, pero gracias."ZNecesito llevar a Phione a algún lugar más seguro, pero te veré. Gracias por todo."Q¿Has visto mi nueva técnica de defensa para avatares? ¡Vamos, pokéarena!".Hmm, vuelvo al punto de partida con esto."lLa técnica es para los avatares, no Entrenadores. No puedo esperar a que funcione perfectamente aquí."-¿Eh? ¿Guerra de climas? ¿Qué es eso?"Norte: Cueva del Albor"Este: Granjas Escarcha"H¡Hey! Eres el... la persona que ví cerca de la Cámara de Regice."1Creo que ya he entendido lo que me ocurrió."XFuera lo que fuera, me mantuvo separado del mundo por un tiempo. Mucho ha cambiado."LEl Team Chasm ya no está. La gente siguió adelante, pero no del todo."�Los Rangers me dieron un espacio. Tengo un montón de viejos amigos que pensaron que estaba muerto. Estaban más que felices de ayudarme cuando regresé."�En cierto modo, Hoopa realmente me ayudó. Pude saltarme un par de las partes más duras de la disolución del Team Chasm, y estoy en un buen lugar."wEstoy... bien. De un modo extraño. Pero eso es la vida, ¿eh? Todo es raro, y luego deja de serlo. Y estás bien."2Esa es la vida. Rara, pero luego estás bien."$Eso se siente bien, ¿no crees?"�¿Estás... aquí? Este ni siquiera es el mapa correcto... Realmente no existe. Más o menos, al menos... Por favor... no hagas trampa cuando combatamos..."?Ojoooooo, ¡Veamos a este pequeño entrenador ahora mismo!"SBueno, llámenme lo que quieran, ¡Pero este Entrenador nos pateó el trasero!"nVaya demostración de nuestro Entrenador aquí. Seguro que tiene uno de esos chismes que hacen caramelos."
