ado! La experiencia adquirida en las batallas es potenciado hasta la próxima vez que te recuperes.;["&You're already feeling pumped up.".You take some swings at the punching bag."\You're pumped up! Experience gain from battles is boosted until the next time you heal.Iu;␀1[[""JAnyone who wants to help with the avatar threat can join the Rangers."WThey're pretty accomodating--anyone who signs up gets stipends for food and board."{That being said, the new demand for housing means some of us have to stay in the bunks until a new place becomes available."+Someone left some free Pokéballs out!"Voltorb cries out!"0You decide not to mess with the Pokéballs.")I just joined the rangers yesterday."So excited!".I just hope they don't send me to Velenz."9Neatly labelled drawers hide messily-filed contents."6Working with the Makyan Rangers has been a blast!"OOnce I took down an avatar, they even gave me one of their snazzy outfits!"*Makes travelling from Kanto worth it!"@Decided to spend part of my gap year here fighting avatars."2I'm pretty homesick, but I won't give up yet."<I know that this'll be something I look back fondly on."An unkempt bed."Yo! Greetings from Unova."Want some Dream Balls?"NThey're a Unovan invention that got improved by some scientists in Galar."QI brought a ton of them with me since I figured I'd catch some Pokemon here."aI've caught all the Pokemon I need though, so I'm giving them out to Trainers who need them."*Anything to combat the avatar threat."ODunno if you can find Dream Balls in Makya, haven't seen any in the shops."3Maybe a specialty shop, but not one in Prizca.""There's crumbs on the sheets."&Someone left this bed in a hurry."=Someone's bed doesn't get as much privacy as the others.""This bed is neatly tucked in.[""JQuien quiera ayudar con la amenaza avatar puede unirse a los Rangers."cSon bastante serviciales–quien sea que se anote obtiene estipendios para comida y hospedaje."�Dicho eso, la nueva demanda de alojamiento signific