ink we’re here for a reason."dLet’s look upstairs. You first, though – something’s off, and you’re the brave warrior."iNot that I want you putting yourself in harm’s way on my behalf… but it would be rather gallant."8Oh? I’ll refrain from reading too much into that.":What I’m worried about is something a bit less fun."TLet’s check upstairs, and be ready. You might end up having to save me again."Am I really that one-note?"]I’ll have to try and be more creative in the future – I can’t stand being cliché."QTo answer your question: I hope not, but there’s only one way to find out."8Shall we look upstairs? At your leisure, of course."fOh, no. I’m not going up there first. You’re the bold and brash one between us, aren’t you?"
Ding!"...it's empty."#You peer down the dusty grate."?You start to feel like you've dropped something important."I'm sorry."Why are you here?"You owe me."	Huh?"So do I."Avatar?[/"MUna página andrajosa de reseñas de clientes está colgada en la pared."HUna atribuida a alguien llamado "Oriel" es particularmente animada."8El agua ha hecho un agujero en el viejo empapelado."JUna fina capa de suciedad forma una costra sobre el acero inoxidable."9La mochila no tiene tanto polvo como todo lo demás."4¿Skyler habrá limpiado antes de que llegaras?"+Todavía hay grasa bajo las hornallas."*La idea de tocarla te da un repelús."'Lleno de latas y botellas antiguas"=Oh. Hola. Me hablas en el peor momento posible, ¿Sabes?"GTécnicamente estoy cometiendo allanamiento de morada ahora mismo."KEste solía ser un cómodo restaurante pequeño operado por una amiga."xElla compró el lugar, lo remodeló para poder cocinar en el primer piso y vivir en el segundo, y ahora está así."Vacío."zOh, no es tan malo. Todo tiene su temporada, y en Makya es meramente verano un día antes de la llegada del invierno."(Un tumulto constante, esta región."DNo lo podía creer al inicio. De que ella simplemente se fuera."cSupuse que siempre sería bienvenido aquí de todos modos, y sé cómo atravesar la cerradura."Eternamente, mi salvador."kY si esa adulación no fue suficiente para ti, ESTUVE intentando encontrar otra manera de compensarte."MDesafortunadamente, la cena no parece estar servida… perdona la broma."R¿Pero puedes sentirlo? ¿El silencio? Creo que estamos aquí por una razón."`Veamos arriba. Pero tu primero – algo no se siente bien, y tú eres el valiente guerrero."WNo es que quiera que te pongas en peligro por mi… pero sería bastante gallardo."0¿Oh? Me abstendré de pensar mucho en eso."8Lo que me preocupa es algo un poco menos divertido."JVeamos arriba, y prepárate. Puede que me tengas que salvar otra vez."$¿De verdad soy tan predecible?"XIntentaré ser un poco más creativo en el futuro – no puedo soportar ser cliché"XPara responder tu pregunto: espero que no, pero sólo hay una forma de comprobarlo."@¿Veremos arriba? Cuando lo veas conveniente, por supuesto."^Oh, no. No iré allí primero. Tu eres el valiente y audaz entre nosotros, ¿Me equivoco?"¡Ding!"...está vacío."%Observas la rejilla polvorienta."@Te da la sensación de que se te ha caído algo importante."Lo siento."¿Por qué estás aquí?"Me lo debes."
¿Eh?"También yo."¿Avatar?;[/"=A tattered page of customer reviews hangs from the wall."JOne attributed to someone named "Oriel" is particularly enthusiastic."<Water damage has torn a hole through the old wallpaper."@A thin layer of grime forms a crust on the stainless steel."0This bag isn't as dusty as everything else.",Did Skyler clean up before you arrived?",There's still grease under the burners."1The thought of touching it makes you queasy.""Full of old cans and bottles."HOh. Hello. You’ve caught me at the absolute worst time, you know?";I’m technically breaking and entering at the moment.">This used to be a cozy little restaurant run by a friend."yShe bought the place, remodeled it so she could cook on the first floor and live on the second, and now it’s this."Empty."sOh, it’s not so bad. Everything has its season, and in Makya it’s barely summer a day before winter comes.""Constant tumult, this region."DI didn’t believe it at first. That she’d just up and leave."RI figured I was always welcome here anyways, and I know my way around a lock."Eternally, my savior."`And if that flattery isn’t enough for you, I WAS trying to find another way to repay you."HUnfortunately, dinner seems to be off the table… no pun intended."QCan you feel that, though? The stillness? I think we’re here for a reason."dLet’s look upstairs. You first, though – something’s off, and you’re the brave warrior."iNot that I want you putting yourself in harm’s way on my behalf… but it would be rather gallant."8Oh? I’ll refrain from reading too much into that.":What I’m worried about is something a bit less fun."TLet’s check upstairs, and be ready. You might end up having to save me again."Am I really that one-note?"]I’ll have to try and be more creative in the future – I can’t stand being cliché."QTo answer your question: I hope not, but there’s only one way to find out."8Shall we look upstairs? At your leisure, of course."fOh, no. I’m not going up there first. You’re the bold and brash one between us, aren’t you?"
Ding!"...it's empty."#You peer down the dusty grate."?You start to feel like you've dropped something important."I'm sorry."Why are you here?"You owe me."	Huh?"So do I."Avatar?Iu;␀[["[A dusty suit, in a state of disrepair. There's signs that bug Pokémon have fed on it."9There's still some long-dried flowers in the pocket."ASo it was an avatar after all. Two, in fact! How delightful!"CSuch grace, such magnificent power, such… oh, words fail me."HBut it is a little convenient, isn’t it? The two of us come here."LI, the sensitive soul, the pilgrim, and you, the knight, the protector.";And what should we find but a Gallade and a Gardevoir."rMaybe so, maybe not. In any case, I’m glad I had you walk upstairs first, and I hope you enjoyed the brawl."}I honestly envy you. You get to see these avatars up close and truly interact with them. All I can do is view them from afar."mSo it would seem. Appearing in the same biome as their regular counterparts makes sense at first glance."`But even that – how do they choose? Do they choose? Or are they pulled here by something?"OAnd if so, where were they before they were pulled here? If only I knew…"pPerhaps I did. Not intentionally, but, well, maybe that’s how I view us. Relationship goals or something."�And somehow that called them, or created them. If so, I’m deeply sorry – I didn’t intend for you to brawl on my behalf today."hAnd thank you. If you hadn’t showed up, that Gallade might’ve decided I had one too many limbs." Oh, I can make up for this."jWell, what do I know – you probably think an opportunity to fight these things is a gift in itself."IBut in case that doesn’t count as me repaying you, have this back."VIt’s told me what I wanted to know – findings I’ll share with you sometime."MI also happened upon this by pure luck while exploring the deep marshes."0It isn’t much, but I want you to have it."LI know this wasn’t exactly what I promised, but I enjoyed it anyways."oI hope you did too, and I’ll see you around. I’ll make it back to you. I promise. Until we meet again."Coincidence."It isn't random?"Did you call them?["VUn traje polvoriento en mal estado. Parece que ha sido comido por Pokémon bicho."8Encuentras flores ya secas en uno de los bolsillos."UAsí que sí era un avatar después de todo. ¡Dos, de hecho! ¡Qué encantador!"WTanta gracia, tan magnífico poder, tan… oh, las palabras no les hacen justicia."NPero es un poco conveniente, ¿No? Que nosotros dos hayamos venido aquí."LYo, el alma sensitiva, el peregrino, y tú, el caballero, el protector."CY por supuesto, nos encontramos con un Gallade y un Gardevoir."Puede que sí, puede que no. En cualquier caso, me alegra que hayas subido primero, y espero que hayas disfrutado la contienda."�Honestamente te envidio. Puedes ver estos avatares de cerca y realmente interactuar con ellos. Todo lo que yo puedo hacer es verlos desde la distancia."tEso parece ser. Aparecer en el mismo bioma que sus contrapartes regulares parece tener sentido a primera vista."`Pero incluso eso – ¿Cómo lo eligen? ¿Acaso lo eligen? ¿O son traídos aquí por algo?"[Y en ese caso, ¿Dónde estaban antes de ser traídos aquí? Si tan solo lo supiera…"sQuizas lo hice. No intencionadamente, pero, bueno, quizás así es como nos veo. Metas de un relación o algo."{Y de algún modo eso los llamó, o los creó. En ese caso, lo siento mucho – no quería que combatieras por mi este día."pY gracias. Si no hubieras aparecido, ese Gallade podría haber decidido que tenía demasiadas extremidades."$Oh, puedo compensarte por esto."xBueno, yo qué sé – probablemente piensas que una oportunidad de combatir estas cosas es un regalo por si mismo."JPero en caso de que eso no cuente como yo recompensandote, toma esto."eMe han dicho lo que quería saber – descubrimientos que compartiré contigo en algún momento."VTambién terminé encontrando esto por pura suerte mientras exploraba el pantano.",No es mucho, pero quiero que lo tengas."VSé que esto no es exactemente lo que prometí, pero lo disfruté de todos modos."uEspero que lo hayas hecho también, y te veré. Te lo compensaré. Te lo prometo. Hasta que nos veamos otra vez."Coincidencia."¿No es aleatoria?"¿Los llamaste?;["[A dusty suit, in a state of disrepair. There's signs that bug Pokémon have fed on it."9There's still some long-dried flowers in the pocket."ASo it was an avatar after all. Two, in fact! How delightful!"CSuch grace, such magnificent power, such… oh, words fail me."HBut it is a little convenient, isn’t it? The two of us come here."LI, the sensitive soul, the pilgrim, and you, the knight, the protector.";And what should we find but a Gallade and a Gardevoir."rMaybe so, maybe not. In any case, I’m glad I had you walk upstairs first, and I hope you enjoyed the brawl."}I honestly envy you. You get to see these avatars up close and truly interact with them. All I can do is view them from afar."mSo it would seem. Appearing in the same biome as their regular counterparts makes sense at first glance."`But even that – how do they choose? Do they choose? Or are they pulled here by something?"OAnd if so, where were they before they were pulled here? If only I knew…"pPerhaps I did. Not intentionally, but, well, maybe that’s how I view us. Relationship goals or something."�And somehow that called them, or created them. If so, I’m deeply sorry – I didn’t intend for you to brawl on my behalf today."hAnd thank you. If you hadn’t showed up, that Gallade might’ve decided I had one too many limbs." Oh, I can make up for this."jWell, what do I know – you probably think an opportunity to fight these things is a gift in itself."IBut in case that doesn’t count as me repaying you, have this back."VIt’s told me what I wanted to know – findings I’ll share with you sometime."MI also happened upon this by pure luck while exploring the deep marshes."0It isn’t much, but I want you to have it."LI know this wasn’t exactly what I promised, but I enjoyed it anyways."oI hope you did too, and I’ll see you around. I’ll make it back to you. I promise. Until we meet again."Coincidence."It isn't random?"Did you call them?0Iu;␀�[[&".You... you're that Mavis kid, aren't you."ZPfft, some wannabe aristocrat you are. Old money? You don't even know the half of it."dI offer you a deal, the location of my personal private island. Not my family's mind you, mine."fI've never been to it, don't even know what's there. My great-grandmother's estate left it to me."XIf you'd like to go to it, simply beat me. It's not like I care what happens to it."THE SPIRITS HERE SCREAM!"PLEASE! IT IS TOO BRIGHT!"HELP ME, LAINIE! HELP ME!"8They can be bested, they can be bested, they can..."aBestie, it's time to invest in our stocks while they're low. We're accepting bestie buyouts!"JTime to cash in on the best bonds... get my bestie estate in order..."7Maybe it's time to invest in you stocks instead..."$Bestie, are you cheating? No..."gGood work bestie, we'll be rolling in bestie bucks if we invest in your bestie business right now."KHmph, a petty child comes to swing at their superiors. What arrogance."zThis... proves nothing. A mere Pokemon battle cannot and will not close the continents of distance between our lines."�Well, if there is one thing the Mavis line is good for, it's savagery. Go on, get your little prize, I'm sure it costs more than mom makes in a decade."dWhat are you trying to talk to me for? Hoping that a shred of my nobility might rub off on you?"bLook at yourself and tell me you'll be anything close to me. You'd be delusional to think so."/A page labeled "Guardian Secret Location"."*It contains a set of GPS coordinates."cA small map details what seems to be the location of an island off the eastern coast of Makya."GBestie stocks are crashing now that they're a confirmed cheater..."<I wonder if we're eligable for a bestie rebate, bestie."6You're our bestie now, of course. Battle besties."aLegends say there was a Trainer here that lost their arm by feeding it to starving L