ly."…So you are like me."I’m sorry. I truly am."<You don’t have to tell me. It won’t change my mind.""Because we can change things."I can, at least. I will."@…This probably isn’t what you were expecting me to say."fDid you want me to quiver and quaver like a child? Stumble over my words and beg for forgiveness?"Sorry. This is me."gThis is the real me – the one I show to my Pokémon. The only ones I can truly talk to. And you."xAll of this is going to be clean white stone in a little while. I wanted to come back just to see it one last time."aCouldn’t stand the idea of talking to anyone. Not Mom, not anyone. It won’t matter soon."Remaking the world."vThe era of human dominance is at an end. With Regigigas’s power, I’ll reset everything back to the beginning."3When the world was new… full of potential…"4I want a world free from this constant boredom."GI want a world in which the ancient power of Pokémon is set free."$I want a brand new blank slate."Yes. I am."?Incapable of relating to humans, or even speaking to them."lMy heart races when they look at me. I am insane, or at least ill. But that doesn’t mean I’m wrong."GI’d expect nothing less. You’re just like me when I was young."/Wanting to be good. So they’d love me…"$…You understand, don’t you?"$Team Chasm uncovered the Regis."hTamarind understood them because she was a scientist. I understood them because they were Pokémon."8Regidrago, when humans cowered in fear of monsters."(Regice, when they huddled in caves."7Regirock, when they built fortifications of stone."(Registeel, when they mastered iron."=Regieleki, when the world was finally theirs to control."XEach one a testament to an era, a chapter in humankind’s domination of the world."pAnd then Regigigas, a remnant of the first era, the primordial era, just after Arceus created the universe."*Arceus created, and Regigigas shaped."<Pokémon were greater, before they became domesticated."iYou’ve seen the echoes of those primordial Pokémon. Soon, that’s what all Pokémon will become."No, not hostile."oYou’re so used to Pokémon being loving and subservient that it’s shocking to see them demand respect.".They’re wild animals. Leave them alone."AWhat about Rattata? What about Boltund? What about Venipede?"WJust another species. Not privileged. Not the center of the universe. Not anymore.")Returned to nothing but white stone."eWho knows what humans will do from there? I’m sure they’ll find a way. They’re persistent.")I’m good with Pokémon. Very good."=I’ll be better off there than here, that’s for sure."KBut I’m wasting your time. I’m only good at one thing, in the end."You ready?"…Alright."6Care to enjoy the view with me? It’s beautiful."&Good. I know you won’t bore me."`Maybe now you’ll understand – this is the only language that we both speak, in the end."+If we’re friends, you’ll fight me."+If we’re enemies, you’ll fight me."Rivals, you’ll fight me."So why, then?"…Don’t say that."%I – I… I care about you too."8I’m sorry. I’m sorry – just… just fight me."+Show me. It’s the only thing I know."3…Then watch as the world you know is erased."It’s that simple."9Answer? No, of course not. You won’t stop me here."NBut it’s how we understand each other better. Show me who you are, \PN.">Oh? You – you really think so? You’ve done so before."EI’m sure you can. Just try. You’ve never let me down before."So, shall we dance?"@Regieleki, Regidrago, you can go now. Return to your tombs."XYou’ll be unmade, too, once this is all done. Just like the eras you commemorate."Do you understand now?"3The real reason? Haven’t I given you enough?"oA world of untapped potential! An end to the boredom! Freeing Pokémon from their saccharine subservience!"$Fine. You want the real reason?"8…Not lying. I just haven’t told you everything."JTo free their potential, to free them from humans, and to free… me."W…Always. Terrified. Not of any Pokémon, never in my life. But always of people."$That’s why I have to do this."pYou don’t understand, \PN. If 