y find challengers wanting."4Your team exceeded on all axes. Take our badge."II’d like to think our candy had something to do with your success."/When you train your Pokémon, think of us."5We – no, I – bear a peculiar responsibility."pThe company allows me to analyze challengers to improve my team, and provides candy and equipment to do so."FI provide my charismatic skills and bring challengers to the gym."[My purpose above all else in this is to test challengers to find a suitable candidate."XSpecifically, for eliminating a remnant of Team Chasm’s tampering with Regigigas."KThat candidate is you, dear. Said remnant is a beast of dire strength."^Find it south of the docks, down the ladder hidden on one of the crescent-shaped islands."Take care."LThe avatar is below the island that bounds the southwest of the harbor."=If you cannot eliminate the avatar, I will find another."6Until then, we thank you for touring our factory."It is done?"	Hah!"Hahah! Hahahah!""My long charade is at an end!"+Change is on the wind for me, darling."XI’d tell you what I’ll do, or where I’m going… but you know I’d be lying."RThese appear to be Victoire’s notes. Most of it is an extensive to-do list."F“Perfume of that smell that’s only found inside of a tank.”"-“Make fusing Pokémon a real thing.”"“Mecha-Fidough.”"'“Be the first woman in space.”"sIn space has been angrily scribbled out and, in much newer ink, ‘on the moon’ has been written beneath it."O...In small letters on the side is scrawled “haute couture spacesuit?”"XA spreadsheet program is open with dozens of tabs, and a dizzing amount of numbers."qBriefly skimming the tab names, you see "Johto Expansion", "Moomoo Milk Sourcing", and "Enigma Berry Tests.""Sorry, not yet."Hah, évidemment.[="?Nos alegraría ponerte a prueba de nuevo, si te gustaría."?Belleza, gracia, fuerza maleable – todo será analizada."2Hola, cariño. ¿Has disfrutado nuestro tour?"MNada trae más luz a nuestros días que ver a nuestros clientes felices."NNada trae 