untainside."9Ah. So it’s done. I just wish we could’ve… no."(History is history. Today is today."OAnd tomorrow is tomorrow – a tomorrow without avatars, if we’re lucky."�Thank you, \PN. I think I’ll take a short break. You’re the last challenger I expected to see before the championship anyways."8You’re always welcome to stop by my home, though!"Two rusty iron longswords.",This is a ceramic statuette of a human!"EThe Ruins Digsite, nearby Team Chasm HQ, contains many of these."8They are estimated to be <imp>3000 years old</imp>!"uThey surround statues of the <imp>legendary golems</imp>: Regice, Regirock, Registeel, Regidrago, and Regieleki!"c<imp>Question for Kids</imp>: If you made a statue of a person or Pokemon, who would you pick?";I have to protect these relics from ruffians like you!"They belong in a museum!"(Must have misjudged your character."7Unlike me, you'd never steal a priceless artifact."
