’re shooting for eleven years in a row!"!Oh, what’s that, Necrozma?"�One day not so far from now you’ll gnaw at the last embers of human civilization? Even our memory will become dust in the cosmic wind?"CYou’re so silly! I sure am glad to have you everywhere I go!"Love... that..."IHey, person that destroyed the avatar of Necrozma puppeting my body!"YPlease go away! Remembering that fiasco is uncomfortable and awkward for both of us!"Get. Out. Now. Scram!"�You. Did not. Just do that. Lainie’s the most generous person in the universe and you spit in her face like this. You disgust me."iGet out of my sight. You’re pathetic – you really are! Don’t show your face around here again."Oh, heya!"nIt’s so nice seeing a new face around here! You’re \PN, aren’t you? I’ve heard so much about you!"NI’m Lainie – you might’ve heard about me? I’m kind of a big deal."SOh good! I’d hate to think that NONE of my friends even mentioned me to you."�Lainie! Winner of the Lainie Award for Staving Off Existential Dread ten years in a row! It’s got my name in it for a reason, you know."�The honor is all mine! I knew you’d drop by sooner or later but I’m still giddy I get to see you in person! The one and only!"XSo, we know each other – you know what that means! It’s time to become friends!"2This is what you do with your friends, right?" You can’t escape forever!"vYay! Don’t expect this to be easy, though! I’m the best of all my friends... and I’ve got a lot of friends."TWow! So you ARE good! You could be one of my bestest friends one day, you know." Oh, but I’m running late!"ZI’ve got an appointment to keep – a li’l rendezvous with some old, OLD friends."<Adieu, \PN! It’s been lovely! You can go now, though!"SHey! She told you you could leave now. Don’t disrespect my friend like that."WUgh. Just gonna traipse on through Lainie’s home? Our home? Some friend you are."YYou aren’t gonna get away with this. Think you can just do whatever you want, huh?"^Lainie’s reuniting with some old friends right now. Please leave. Immediately. Or else."tDon’t be surprised if everyone unfriends you after this. Betraying Lainie is beyond the pale. Unforgivable..."@Lainie... I’m sorry. I’ll try better next time, friend."Take it."Don't take it."I've heard of you."	Who?"It's an honor."Uh, I need to go."Let's do this.[,"_¡Hey! ¡Aún estoy llevando la personificación de un vacío cielo sin estrellas conmigo!"e¡Es un recordatorio constante de la permanencia de la muerte! ¡Por favor quitámelo de encima!"�¡Yay! ¡Ahora tengo una oportunidad para ganar el Premio Lainie por Prever Temor Existencial! ¡Vamos por la onceava edición seguida!"!Oh, ¿Qué ocurre, Necrozma?"�¿Algún día no muy lejano vas a consumir los últimos remanentes de la civilización humana? ¿Incluso nuestra memoria se convertirá en ceniza dentro del vacío cósmico?"M¡Eres tan gracioso! ¡Estoy seguro que te tendré a donde sea que vaya!"Amo… eso…"O¡Hey, persona que destruyó el avatar de Necrozma que manejaba mi cuerpo!"S¡Por favor vete! ¡Recordar ese fiasco es incómodo y raro para nosotros dos!"Vete. Ahora. ¡Fuera!"No. Lo hiciste. Sólo hazlo. Lainie es la persona más generosa en el universo y le escupes en la cara así. Me disgustas."gFuera de mi vista. Eres patético – ¡Realmente lo eres! No muestres tu cara por aquí de nuevo."Oh, ¡hey!"Y¡Es genial ver una nueva cara por aquí! ¿Eres \PN, no? ¡He oído mucho sobre ti!"LSoy Lainie – ¿Puedes haber oído sobre mi? Soy la gran cosa, diría."W¡Oh, bien! Odiaría pensar que NINGUNO de mis amigos me haya siquiera mencionado."�¡Lainie! Ganadora del Premio Lainie por Prever Temor Existencial por diez años seguidos! Tiene mi nombre en él por una razón, sabes."�¡El honor es todo mío! ¡Sabía que aparecerías por aquí tarde o temprano pero aún así estoy entusiasmada por verte en persona! ¡El único e inigualable!"eAsí que, nos conocemos el uno al otro – ¡Ya sabes lo que significa! ¡Es hora de ser amigos!"2¿Eso es lo que haces con tus amigos, cierto?"%¡No puedes escapar por siempre!"m¡Yay! ¡Pero, no esperes que esto sea fácil! Soy la mejor entre mis amigos… y tengo muchos de ellos."U¡wow! ¡Eres TAN bueno! Algún día podrías ser el mejor de mis amigos, sabes."%Oh, ¡Pero estoy llegando tarde!"WTengo un lugar al que ir – una pequeña reunión con unos viejos, VIEJOS amigos.">¡Adieu, \PN! ¡Ha sido maravilloso! ¡Ahora puedes irte!"a¡Hey! Ella te dijo que podías irte ahora. No le faltes el respeto a mi amiga de esa forma."^Ugh. ¿Así que vas a deambular por el hogar de Lainie? ¿Nuestro hogar? Vaya amigo eres."aNo vas a salirte con la tuya en esto. ¿Piensas que puedes hacer lo que sea que quieras, eh?"kLainie se está reuniendo con unos viejos amigos ahora mismo. Por favor vete. Inmediatamente. O si no."}No te sorprendas si todos dejan de ser tus amigos después de esto. Traicionar a Lainie es pasarse de la raya. Inaceptable…"ELainie… Lo siento. Lo intentaré mejor la próxima vez, amiga."Tomarlo."No tomarlo."Oí sobre ti."¿Quién?"Ha sido un honor."Eh, tengo que irme."Hagamos esto.;[,"OHey! I’m still carrying the embodiment of an empty starless sky with me!"XIt’s like a constant reminder of the permanence of death! Please take it from me!"�Yay! Now I have a shot at winning the Lainie Award for Staving Off Existential Dread! We’re shooting for eleven years in a row!"!Oh, what’s that, Necrozma?"�One day not so far from now you’ll gnaw at the last embers of human civilization? Even our memory will become dust in the cosmic wind?"CYou’re so silly! I sure am glad to have you everywhere I go!"Love... that..."IHey, person that destroyed the avatar of Necrozma puppeting my body!"YPlease go away! Remembering that fiasco is uncomfortable and awkward for both of us!"Get. Out. Now. Scram!"�You. Did not. Just do that. Lainie’s the most generous person in the universe and you spit in her face like this. You disgust me."iGet out of my sight. You’re pathetic – you really are! Don’t show your face around here again."Oh, heya!"nIt’s so nice seeing a new face around here! You’re \PN, aren’t you? I’ve heard so much about you!"NI’m Lainie – you might’ve heard about me? I’m kind of a big deal."SOh good! I’d hate to think that NONE of my friends even mentioned me to you."�Lainie! Winner of the Lainie Award for Staving Off Existential Dread ten years in a row! It’s got my name in it for a reason, you know."�The honor is all mine! I knew you’d drop by sooner or later but I’m still giddy I get to see you in person! The one and only!"XSo, we know each other – you know what that means! It’s time to become friends!"2This is what you do with your friends, right?" You can’t escape forever!"vYay! Don’t expect this to be easy, though! I’m the best of all my friends... and I’ve got a lot of friends."TWow! So you ARE good! You could be one of my bestest friends one day, you know." Oh, but I’m running late!"ZI’ve got an appointment to keep – a li’l rendezvous with some old, OLD friends."<Adieu, \PN! It’s been lovely! You can go now, though!"SHey! She told you you could leave now. Don’t disrespect my friend like that."WUgh. Just gonna traipse on through Lainie’s home? Our home? Some friend you are."YYou aren’t gonna get away with this. Think you can just do whatever you want, huh?"^Lainie’s reuniting with some old friends right now. Please leave. Immediately. Or else."tDon’t be surprised if everyone unfriends you after this. Betraying Lainie is beyond the pale. Unforgivable..."@Lainie... I’m sorry. I’ll try better next time, friend."Take it."Don't take it."I've heard of you."	Who?"It's an honor."Uh, I need to go."Let's do this.Iu;␀�[[<"kWait... I know that feeling. That’s the feeling I get when someone wants to ask an obvious question!"fHow did I catch Necrozma anyways? Well, what can I say: I’ve got friends in high places! Ahaha!"Oh! You’re here!"FYou’re in luck – I just finished my <outln2>reunion</outln2>."UThey still remember me! They still love me! They still <outln2>obey me</outln2>!"{And I love them too! I’m gonna show everything how much I love it! I’m gonna wrap up the sun and the moon in a big hug!"�And then you! And then everything else! And I’m never going to let them go! You know how I told you I was kind of a big deal...?"I meant it!"bNow don’t be scared! You have everything that makes life worth the fight! Friendship! Love!"M<outln2>Light</outln2>! They’ll all be mine! <outln2>FOREVER!</outln2>"RCome back! My friends still have so much <outln2>light</outln2> left to give!",Hahaha! ENDLESS <outln2>LIGHT</outln2>!".Look at me! Radiant, forever! Bask in it!"The... light... am I OK?"*Whoa. I remember... some WEIRD stuff!"Did – Solgaleo and Lunala must’ve bolted. Can’t blame ‘em, hah! I guess I kinda did go a little light-crazy there."$Great question! I have no idea!"oSomething horrible, probably! Fortunately, I’m naturally trauma-immune, so I’ve got that going for me!"ZOkie-dokie! There’s nothing that Lainie can’t spring back from! Even, uh... that."@On li’l old Lainie? That’s why it pays to have friends!"pThey’ll never believe you! And even if they did, they’re Makyan police! Don’t worry about it so much!"pAs far as I can tell, my mind was hijacked by an extradimensional intelligence of nebulous nature! I dunno!"vMaybe avatars of Ultra Beasts work differently – I’m not a scientist! Unless you count my PhD in friendology."{All I know is I came back to Makya with an amazing catch. Next thing I know I want to become friends with the moon and sun!"_That’s not really out of character for me, though, so nobody noticed anything was wrong!"#Let me put it in simple terms!"~Lainie go Alola. Lainie come back. Lainie feel weeeeird. Lainie accidentally summon manifestations of sun and moon. Oops!"OK!"Aaapaaaarreeeentlyyy."Neeecrooozmaaa."Caaan – OK, nevermind."vApparently Necrozma can call Solgaleo and Lunala from across the universe so it can feed off their eternal light!"&Cool! Also, sorry about that one!"bOnly legally, and only in Sinnoh! They couldn’t catch me to ge