 friend hast did search for many a worthy trainer. However in this present time we may find that trainer before us!"LRennyo hast did talk about thy battle prowess for many a day and night!"9But perhaps you are a Marshadow of your former self?"INonsense! I'm sure this Trainer will show us a fighter most valiant!";Whether they win or not, however, is another matter...":What say you Trainer, another round against my troop?"Gentlemen! To arms!"(Yes! Onwards my men, into the fray!"dCowardice? Or strategy? It will be revealed to us which of the two is present here soon enough."SIt would seem that our combined might has been bested once again. What a show!"VI should have surmised as much! All four of us felt your might as you approached."JIt should come at no surprise that our new friend wishes to meet you."QPack it up gentlemen! Our quest into the dark catacombs has reached its end!"What serendipity!"WThe Trainer yond did prove themselves worthy hast hath found our merry band again!"4This timeth however, our company is one bigger!"5Findeth us once more for a showdown of the ages!"..."	...."2nd larper"AMarshadow gives you a confident smirk, puffing up its chest."ZIt probably wants to join your team. It gives gestures while holding up its Pokeball.")Accept the Marshadow onto your team?";You decide to decline the Marshadow's request for now.".You take the Pokeball from the Marshadow."5With a dramatic pose, it re-enters its Pokeball."Let's go."Onwards! Into battle!"Not right now."No."	Yes.0000Iu;␀�][[�"K"Fair Makya endures, as though all of time might be but a single day,""/"And with each second, all cycles repeat,""N"May prosperity sing long through the hours and into the black of night,"","and may turmoil last but a heartbeat.""{Eifion’s Manaphy undulates with excitement upon seeing you. It seems to be more confident than when you saw it last, too."5Perhaps it’s readying itself for a rematch...?"M\PN. I hope you know I had to delay a meeting with the board to be here."zFortunately I have the sway to simply tell people when and where I’ll hold my meetings. I am never late, et cetera."YYou’ve certainly proven yourself. Did you ever get around to demolishing Tamarind?"HI’ll have to ask her about it... perhaps open up some old wounds."
Hmph.">Regardless, you’ve saved our operations in this region."As well as this region."And us."Thank you."~I plan to inquire with you in the future as how best to handle LuxTech and Mavis... but that’s business. Enjoy the ceremony."7"In Spring the boy is born, we celebrate the day,""3"Soon the King of Summer leads us on our way.""...An empty seat."eNothing to note here, except for a faint scent. Smells like... clear water, and white flowers..."0"Plains, mountains, marsh and white brick,""A"We build this castle true to the earth on which it stands,""%"United, never brought to heel,""-"As is our pride in these Makyan lands.""HYo! Great to see you again! Man, it feels like it’s been forever."kGonna be honest: it’s really damn hard sitting here. Just, like, it was supposed to be me, y’know?"EBut don’t get me wrong: you earned this. You gave 110 percent."9Maybe more like 150, honestly. Glad I got to see it."+Hey. Didn’t expect to see me, right?"kI didn’t expect to be here, honestly. Got the invite from Tamarind and nearly threw it in the trash."4But I figured, ah, why not? So, uh, I’m here.")Good job becoming Champion. I guess?"aGonna be honest: I don’t really know you. But I guess you’re cool, so… yeah, congrats."bFreeing me from being a gym leader is worth a thousand times more to me than this whole mess."<"By Autumntide his wisdom, through the land runs deep,""J"And though his reign brought naught but joy, in Wintertime we weep.""AYou done lollygagging? We can get started whenever you want."JYou want me to count the number of seconds we’ve got this room for?"+Because I can. I’ve got a timer set."%Fine, go. Make it quick, though.".Let’s get this started. Quick ceremony."FPurely, uh, ceremonial. I don’t even have a trophy to give you."Alright…"bWith the shockingly broad powers invested in me as Makya’s regional Professor, I hereby –"1Is this the part where I say “I object?”""\PN. You’re looking better."UHelluva lot better than last time I saw you, to be honest. This place suits you."2So does not burning the Litwick at both ends."Damn straight!"xSorry I’m late – my companion here apparently has some outstanding warrants and I needed to grease a few palms."You know how it is."*That’s me! But, seriously, c’mon."^You got the title of Champion the second you beat me. You want her to tell you it, or me?"Hahaha!"1Hey, kiddo. Are you actually glad to see me?"9I can’t even remember the last time that happened.",Oh, but I’m forgetting: this is Zoé."You two’ve met, I know."�After I left, I ran into her. One thing led to another, and now we’re a thing. Sorry to break your heart if you were hoping for an edgy industrial goth GF.">*hiss* The mask’s practical, idiot! And I’m not edgy!"\Ugh. If you want edge, I’ll show you edge. Wait till you see me dressed to the nines."He wishes."<...Ugh. Sorry, that’s reflexive. Yes, we’re dating."$*hiss* Leave Mavis out of this.":I haven’t even met her and I already hate her guts."`You talking to me or him? 'Cause we both disappeared for a few months. It’s a long story."#Oh, no, keep going, you three."rI really want to hear more about which of you is dating the gym leader I forgot existed. We’ve got all day."XActually, you know what, that’s a good point. Fine, Zain, you were the runner-up."`You do the ceremony! I finally get to delegate! Now I know what it feels like to be Helena!"DYou three gremlins get this figured out. I’m done! I’m out!"-OK, I think it goes something like this."uWith the – what’d she say? – shockingly broad powers invested in me? As, what, your jackass older brother?"LWith said powers, I hereby bestow upon you, \PN, the title of Champion."oY’know, for being a spoiled rich brat and a golden child, you’re actually pretty cool. You want a hug?"Aww, kid. Damn..."4*hiss* Sorry. You two are too cute not to join."^\PN, I promise we’re gonna take care of you from now on whether you like it or not, OK?"xZain and I have been talking about you and Mavis and everything and... yeah. We’re gonna adopt you if we have to."uWell, that’s moving a little fast... but, yeah. What she means to say is that I want to make things up to you."(And that means being there for you."zSo, y’know, if things don’t work out with Mavis and you need someone... we’re your family. If you’ll have us."	Hah!"-Don’t worry, I get it. I deserve that."JBut, uh, listen, kid: if you need me, I’m here. Same goes for Zoé."XIf things don’t work out with Mavis, we’ll be your family. If you’ll have us."'You never gotta be alone. Alright?"UOf course. You’re welcome, kiddo. Champion. \PN. Whatever you’re called now."\I can’t promise much, but I’ll be there for you. Things are gonna be different now."GLove you too. Can’t believe I didn’t for a little while there."eBut, hey, we can’t change the past, right? Only the future. Things are gonna be different now."9I know you will. You’re tough, and you’re smart."?But if you ever aren’t fine, I’m here for you. We are."'Things are gonna be different now."WIt would be totally disrespectful to leave now, while everyone is waiting for you!"Hello, nondescript friend!"VI am studiously not remembering any prior interaction we may or may not have had!"aI am present at this location to support you in whatever endeavor you are here to undertake!"RI do this because you are my friend and Lainie does not let her friends down!"}Even if sometimes she really wishes she could just forget about them and the incredibly awkward things they witnessed...")White carnations. A symbol of Makya."Hello, \PN."{The importance of the Champion title is lost on me, but I received an invitation, and had no intention of refusing it."^Consider this minor show of moral support repayment for your assistance. Congratulations."Hey! \PN! Great work!"�I am absolutely STOKED that you got an actual ceremony. I sent Tamarind five letters telling her how disappointed I was that the whole thing got ruined!"oI, uh, also tried to see if Zoé would show up, but she’s still gone. Starting to get worried about her."/But that’s a me problem! You just relax!"0Howdy. Hope you ain’t feelin’ stood up."]I plan on buyin' you a drink, never you worry. Just ain't been feelin' it with Yez gone."�Part of my mind just ain’t in the here and now. Figured I’d show up for this, at least. I’ve been thinkin’ 'bout you more than I’d like to admit. Hah!"cDon’tcha go givin’ me that look. Go on. Git. We’ll have time enough for chit-chat later."Hah. Damn kid..."GHey! Lookin’ pretty good. Sorry this took so long to get set up."~We were supposed to get you officially coronated as Champion right after the tournament, but then there was The Incident."wAnd since it takes eight billion years to get anything through bureaucracy limbo here, it’s... how late is this?""Three months? Two and a half?"DOh, and we only have thirty minutes, so let’s keep it moving."iThanks. Can’t help but notice you didn’t say I was lookin’ good... but that’s fair, I guess."kFor one, I’m like twenty-five years older than you. And, uh, for two I’ve got some grey coming in.",Never let it be said I aged with grace."pBut who’s counting? You want me to tell you I’m sorry? You know me well enough to know I’m not gonna."TI’ve had enough on my plate without trying to set up your little victory lap."You’re very welcome."TAt least someone appreciates the monumental effort I put into this damn region."]You know how hard it is to get even a single person in a room for half an hour in Makya?"AEveryone’s always scheming or brooding or committing sins."@But like I said, we’re on a timer, so let’s get moving."nI know certain individuals who will remain unnamed will have their eyes on their watches the entire time."uHonestly I can’t believe the stars aligned to get everyone I needed in one place for this long. Minor miracle."%Anyways! Let’s go, let’s go!"gThere’s a letter on the table. The paper smells faintly of perfume, and you know it’s for you."R“Congratulations. You deserve this. You’re this region’s gleaming star."LMake them respect you. Make them worship you. They don’t deserve you."gPlease accept my utmost apologies for not being able to attend. I still have matters to attend to."gLoose ends to be wrapped up – or severed. We’ll be together soon, and then never parted again."Ever yours, S.”"&Hmph. Nice to see you doing well."}It was only a walk to get here, and I needed an excuse to get out anyways. I don’t really keep up with current events."BGuess you did pretty well, though. That tracks. I can see it."3Takes a lot to impress me. You do. Keep at it."�There’s a Ditto in attendance. It roils amicably, seemingly glad that its mythical counterpart is taking the attention off of it."It gleams up at you with pinpoint eyes. You’re sure in its head it’s making a joke about you, but not at your expense."eHats off to you, champ. The moment you first beat me, I knew you were in this for the long haul."FIf only I knew how right I was. I would’ve made some bets! Hah!".Hey, Champion! Didn’t expect to see me?"rI’ve been, like, superglued to Tammy’s side the past few months. Couldn’t get away even if I wanted to."]But, like, I wouldn’t miss it for the world, dummy! Love ya way too much to miss this!"oAh, my dear \PN. I’ve been watching your ascendance with prying eyes ever since I eloped unto the night."ZYou show such grace and strength! No one could be disappointed with your performance."<But there’s someone you wish was here, isn’t there?"^Never fear! A late entrance is a dramatic entrance, wouldn’t you agree, darling? Ahaha!"#"May our swords remain sharp,"""And our enemies routed,"""May never the words""!"Of our leaders be doubted.""NThere’s a Mew in attendance. Nobody seems to know what to make of that."�Personally, the Mew seems to be exulting in being an enigma. It also seems rather proud of you, and its similarly-mutable companion."pYour suffering has reached its end! The long, arduous climb has culminated with you at the zenith of Makya!"JI hope beyond hope that my tempering has contributed to your victory."XNow that role belongs to you! Test all challengers! Test them with fury and frenzy!"(Oh, \PN, I’m so happy to see you!"aYou deserve to have your victory celebrated. You’ve done so much for all of us. Thank you."kNow go enjoy your time in the spotlight – even if this ceremony is a little smaller than I’d like."One sec."Yeah, I'm ready."
Zain."You made it!"Jackass."Hey, kiddo."Sure you aren't."You're dating?"Mavis know?" That's where you’ve been?"Hug him."Don't hug him."Thanks, Zain."Love you."I'll be fine."Good to see you too."Two months, twenty days."Thanks.[�"K"Fair Makya endures, as though all of time might be but a single day,""/"And with each second, all cycles repeat,""N"May prosperity sing long through the hours and into the black of night,"","and may turmoil last but a heartbeat.""wEl Manaphy de Eifion se ondula con emoción al verte. También parece más seguro que la última vez que lo viste."8¿Quizás se está preparando para una revancha...?"\\PN. Espero que sepas que tuve que retrasar una reunión con la junta para estar aquí."�Afortunadamente tengo la influencia para simplemente decirle a la gente donde y cuando tendrés mis reuniones. Nunca llego tarde, etcetera."VCiertamente has demostrado tu valía. ¿Alguna vez llegaste a demoler a Tamarind?"STendré que preguntarle al respecto... quizás abrir un par de viejas heridas."
