h away that you'd rather not touch it."2An empty oil drum labeled "WATER FOR AGGRON"."&The sides are scuffed and dented."`Shh, don't report me. This is the most hidden place in the city. No one ever finds me here.":Plus, I can torrent whatever I want on the WiFi here."Don't give coffee."Give coffee.000Iu;␀	[["FThere seem to be rocks in here. Does he feed this to his Pokemon?".Books on gym construction and management."lOn top of a row of books, a copy of "Forged in Fire: Multi-Battle Synergy for Rivals" lays on its side.")Older books on Pokémon maintenance."MThere's a strong focus on maintaining the health of aggressive battlers."=Bence almost has a week of prepared meals in the fridge."TOne day is missing. An empty wrapper seems to have had a "Z" scribbled onto it."4A high-quality photograph of a forest clearing."cPieces of hair are at the edges of the sink. This must be where Bence trims that beard of his."It's an old picture book."DYou see a few photos of Bence with a Hoppip and Alolan Geodude."BIt seems like they lost a lot of Pokemon battles back then...["LParece haber rocas aquí. ¿Acaso él alimenta a sus Pokémon con esto?"6Libros sobre construcción y manejo de gimnasios."jEncima de la fila de libros, puedes ver una copia de "Sinergias en Combates Múltiples para Rivales"."*Libros viejos sobre cuidado Pokémon."EHay un gran foco en mantener la salud de combatientes agresivos."JBence casi tiene una semana de comidas preparadas en el frigorífico."GFalta un día. Un envoltorio vacío parece tener una "Z" dibujada."3Una foto en alta calidad de un claro forestal."`Pedazos de pelo están en el filo del fregadero. Parece que aquí es donde Bence se afeita.""Es un viejo libro de dibujos."BVes algunas fotos de Bence con un Hoppip y un Geoduded Alola."DParece que perdían muchos combates Pokémon en ese entonces...;["FThere seem to be rocks in here. Does he feed this to his Pokemon?".Books on gym construction and management."lOn top of a row of books, a copy of "Forg