 to be stronger than you. \PN has that handled."0I know <i>you</i>. We're going to stop you."3Latching onto someone greater than you, I see?"MIt won't make a difference. The Drillers have learned from our mistakes."'We won't be humiliated ever again."2We have the strength. We can keep Makya safe."Drillers! Give no ground!")I've got you. Let me heal your team."REveryone would benefit from the Forces being under our control. Even you two!"0A battle will convince you of your mistake."*Two grunts down. Just one more to go!""You find it so hard to trust?"9Sometimes other people just know better than you do."HI've committed the same sin. Seek redemption with me, here and now.";You did it! I still can't believe how skilled you are."Drillers!"'I'll handle this next part myself." Retreat to Circuit Station.Iu;␀�[["BThe floating rock contains a <imp>hemispherical indent</imp>."2It emanates a sense of loss, and of yearning.""You take out the Light Stone."2It warms your palms as you approach the rock."$It fits neatly into the recess.")You feel a sense of a weight lifted."GWithout you noticing how, the Light Stone is returned to your bag."The rock is satisfied."!You take out the Dark Stone."1It warm your palms as you approach the rock."FWithout you noticing how, the Dark Stone is returned to your bag."@The door seems to bend and stretch the more you look at it."MOverlapping textures combine and fall apart, but never leave an opening."SDespite the visual array in front of you, it is smooth and still to the touch."XA desire for unification slips into your mind, but the other half is still missing."AWith a sense of catharsis that is not yours, the door opens.["AEl orbe flotante contiene una <imp>marca semicircular</imp>."1Emana un sentimiento de derrota y de anhelo."Tomas el Orbe Claro."ASientes un calor en tus manos mientras te acercas a la roca."(Entra perfectamente en el recoveco."Te sientes alividos."BNo sabes cómo, pero el Orbe Claro es regresado a tu mochila."La 