. User becomes Steel-type."gThe user cloaks itself in fire and charges at the foe, burning it. The user also takes 33% recoil."fThe user attacks by breathing a special, hot fire. This lowers the target's Sp. Atk by six steps."aThe user lays two hazard layers of burning spikes on the foe's side. User becomes Fire-type."HThe user inflicts burns on all nearby foes. User becomes Fire-type."iThe user summons sunshine for six turns. This raises its Attack and Sp. Atk. User becomes Fire-type."iA spray of bubbles is forcefully ejected at all nearby foes. This lowers their Speed by three steps."�The user enters a state of total focus, prevents stat steps from being lowered, raises Attack and Sp. Def, and becomes Water-type."kThe user summons rainstorm for six turns and surrounds itself with Aqua Ring. User becomes Water-type."LThe user inflicts waterlog on all nearby foes. User becomes Water-type."xA move that only the avatar of Kyogre can use. The user commands a Luvdisc avatar and a Remoraid avatar to join it."[The user forcefully shoots six seeds in rapid succession, spread among nearby enemies."aA nutrient-draining attack. The user's HP is restored by all the damage taken by the target."WThe user charges by gathering light, then blasts all near foes on the second turn."�The user heals all non-volatile status conditions on their side, gains the ability Stability, heals itself for 25% HP and becomes Grass-type."IThe user inflicts leech on all nearby foes. User becomes Grass-type."hThe user raises its Defense by two steps and gains the ability Iron Barbs. User becomes Grass-type."]The user scatters bursts of spores to induce sleep on all foes. User becomes Grass-type."The user summons an allied Gossifleur. This raises its Sp. Def by three steps, and its allies' by one. User becomes Grass-type."FA powerful electric blast is let loose on the target, numbing it."TThe user raises its Sp. Atk and Speed by two steps. User becomes Electric-type."KThe user inflicts numb on all 