tasma ."KEl usuario ataca tres veces rápido como una bala. Siempre va primero."oEl usuario es golpeado con garras metálicas dos veces. Aumenta el Ataque del usuario luego de cada golpe."gEl objetivo es obliterado por un golpea meteórico. Esto aumenta el Ataque del usuario dos grados."cEl usuario aumenta su Defensa cuatro grados, gana la habilidad Filtro, y se vuelve tipo Acero."oEl usuario se concentra, haciendo que todos sus siguientes ataques sean críticos, y se vuelve tipo Acero."El usuario aumenta su Defensa Especial dos grados y gana la habilidad Retroalimentación. El usuario se vuelve tipo Acero."sThe user creates a Polarized Room for six turns. This raises its Defense and Sp. Def. User becomes Steel-type."uUna danza que aumenta el espíritu combativo. El usuario aumenta su Ataque cuatro grados y se vuelve tipo Acero."xEl usuario se envuelve en fuego y embiste al objetivo, quemándolo. El usuario recibe un 33% de daño de retroceso."dEl usuario ataca con un ardiente fuego especial. Esto disminuye el Ataque Especial seis grados."cEl usuario esparce 2 capas de púas ardientes en el lado contrario, y se vuelve de tipo Fuego."HEl usuario quema al lado rival. El usuario se vuelve de tipo Fuego."rEl usuario invoca la luz solar durante seis gurnos, potenciando ambos de sus Ataques, y se vuelve tipo Fuego."mUn rayo de burbujas es disparado con fuerza a rivales cercanos. Esto disminuye su Velocidad tres grados."�El usuario se concentra por completo, impidiendo que sus stats sean reducidas, aumenta Ataque, Defensa Especial, y se vuelve tipo Agua."rEl usuario invoca tormenta de lluvia durante seis turnos, es rodeado por un Acua Aro,  y se vuelve tipo Agua."JEl usuario embebe a rivales cercanos. El usuario se vuelve tipo Agua."|Un movimiento que sólo el avatar de Kyogre puede utilizar. El usuario llama un avatar de Luvdisc y Remoraid para asistirlo."UEl usuario dispara seis semillas de forma seguida, entre todo el lado contrario."aUn ataque drenador de nutrientes. El usuario recupera todos los PS que le quite al objetivo."aEl usuario carga reuniendo luz, luego la dispara a los rivales cercanos en el segundo turno."�El usuario recupera los problemas de estado no volátiles en su equipo y gana la habilidad Estabilidad, recupera el 25% de sus PS totales y se vuelve tipo Planta."HEl usuario infecta a los rivales cercanos, y se vuelve tipo Planta."pEl usuario aumenta su Defensa dos grados y gana la habilidad Punta Acero. El usuario se vuelve tipo Planta."bEl usuario esparce esporas para dormir a todos los rivales, y luego se vuelve de tipo Planta."|El usuario invoca un Gossifleur aliado, aumenta su Defensa Especial tres grados, y sus aliados uno, y se vuelve tipo Planta."<El usuario ataca con un rayo eléctrico, aturdiéndolo."`El usuario aumenta su Ataque Especial y Velocidad dos grados,  y se vuelve tipo Eléctrico."KEl usuario aturde a los rivales cercanos, y se vuelve tipo Eléctrico."`Dos turnos después de que este movimiento sea usado, energía psíquica ataca al objetivo."sEl usuario aumenta su Defensa Especial cuatro grados, gana la habilidad Ignorante, y se vuelve tipo Psíquico."}El usuario aumenta su Ataque Especial y Defensa Especial dos grados, maximiza su Precisión, y se vuelve tipo Psíquico."[Invoca eclipse durante seis turnos, aumenta ambos Ataques, y se vuelve tipo Psíquico."kRebota ataques de estado durante los siguientes tres turnos, y el usuario se vuelve de tipo Psíquico."rEl usuario invoca un Abra aliado, aumenta su Ataque Especial y el de sus aliados, y se vuelve tipo Psíquico."bThe user creates an Odd Room for six turns. This raises its Speed. User becomes Psychic-type."�El usuario emplea sugestión hipnótica para que todos los objetivos con un problema de estado sean dormidos. El usuario se vuelve de tipo Psíquico."HEl usuario ataca con un rayo de cero absoluto, helando al objetivo."@El usuario hiela al lado contrario, y se vuelve tipo Hielo."hEl usuario coloca dos capas púas heladas en el lado contrario. El usuario se vuelve de tipo Hielo."El usuario invoca un granizo durante seis turnos, disminuye la Velocidad del lado contrario dos grados, y se vuelve tipo Hielo."ZEl usuario aumenta su Ataque, Defensa y Velocidad dos grados, y se vuelve tipo Hielo."�El usuario aplasta a rivales cercanos con malas intenciones. Duplica su daño contra objetivos con problemas de estado no-volátiles."HEl usuario exhala un fuerte tornado que daña y aturde al objetivo."�Un movimiento que solo puede usar el avatar de Zekrom. Todos los combatientes ganan el tipo Acero y sus cambios de stats son reiniciados."SEl usuario aumenta su Ataque y Velocidad dos grados, y se vuelve tipo Dragón."mEl usuario disminuye la mejor stats ofensiva del lado contrario cuatro grados, y se vuelve tipo Dragón."xUn movimiento que solo puede usar el avatar de Reshiram. Sube todas las stats de todos los combatientes dos grados."El usuario invoca un Poochyena aliado, aumenta su Ataque tres grados, y el de sus aliados uno, y se vuelve tipo Siniestro."{El usuario tormenta a todos los objetivos cercanos, impidiendo que repita movimientos. El usuario se vuelve tipo Siniestro."iEl usuario ataca al lado rival con el poder de la luna, disminuyendo su Ataque Especial tres grados."OEl usuario aumenta su Ataque Especial cuatro grados y se vuelve tipo Hada."qInvoca brillo lunar durante seis turnos, aumenta las stats defensivas de todo aliado, y se vuelve tipo Hada."oThe user creates a Puzzle Room for six turns. This raises its Attack and Sp. Atk. User becomes Fairy-type."AThis move exists just to showcase the PBS Extensions system.;[�"NThe user helps the target and makes it use its move right after the user."bThe user hurriedly and randomly uses a move among those known by other Pokémon in the party."EThe user maximizes its Attack in exchange for 33% of its max HP."WThe user passes its held item to the target when the target isn't holding an item."`The user endures attacks for two turns, then strikes back to cause double the damage taken."UThe user traps the target by physically blocking its way or scaring it in place."[The user drops onto the target with its full body weight. It has a 30% chance to numb."eThe user attacks everything around it with the destructive power of a terrible, explosive sound."KThe user changes its type to become the same type as one of its moves."iThe user changes its type to make itself resistant to the type of the attack the opponent used last."hThe user approaches the target, then steals their item. Items stolen from wild Pokémon are stored."ZThe target is hit with rhythmically launched punches that have a 30% chance to dizzy."EA reckless, life-risking tackle. The user also takes 33% recoil."mThe user attacks the foe with an echoing voice. If this move is used every turn, it does greater damage."ZThe user compels the target to keep using only the move it last used for three turns."JAn attack move that cuts down the target's HP to equal the user's HP."aThe user endures any attack with at least 1 HP. It always fails if it is used in succession."jThe user dances to compel the target to mimic it, making the target's Ability the same as the user's."bThe user explodes to inflict damage on those around it. The user faints upon using this move."aThe user rushes the target at blinding speed. This attack always goes before any other move."xDoubles its power if the user has a non-volatile status condition. Ignores damage reduction from burn or frostbite."oAn attack that hits first and makes the target flinch. It only works the first turn the user is in battle."bThe user flails about aimlessly to attack. It becomes more powerful the less HP the user has."WEnables random critical hits for the user, and quadruples its critical hit chance."eThe user draws attention to itself, making all foes' moves get redirected to the user this turn."[The target is multi-hit two to five times with raking swipes. Can random critical hit."hThe user rushes at the target using every bit of its power. The user is exhausted on the next turn."GThe user intimidates the target by staring at it to cause numbing."PThe user growls, scaring nearby foes. Their Attack is lowered by two steps."WThe user stiffens all the muscles in its body to raise its Defense by three steps."dThe user sticks out its head and attacks by slamming into the foe. It has a 50% chance to numb."oThe user makes a soothing bell chime to heal the non-volatile status conditions of all the party Pokémon."NThe user assists an ally by boosting the power of its next attack by 50%."TThe user holds back when it attacks, and the target is left with at least 1 HP."VThe foe is attacked with a powerful beam. The user is exhausted on the next turn."fThe user bites hard on the target with its sharp fangs. It has a 50% chance to flinch the target."SThe user lets loose a horribly echoing shout with the power to inflict damage."lThe user releases countless shots of light. Its type varies with the kind of Plate the user is holding."cThis move can be used only after the user has used all the other moves it knows in the battle."ZThe user leers at nearby foes with sharp eyes. Their Defense is lowered by two steps."~If the user acts before the target, it copies the target’s attacking move and uses it against them with 50% increased power."FThe target is slugged by a punch thrown with muscle-packed power."\The user waggles a finger and stimulates its brain into randomly using nearly any move."qCloaking itself in high energy, the user slams into the target. This move's type depends on the held memory."^The user draws power to attack by using a held Berry. The Berry used determines its type."oAn attack that makes use of nature's power. Its effects and type vary depending on the user's environment."ZThe user intimidates all nearby foes, lowering their Attack and Sp. Atk by two steps."ONumerous coins are hurled at the target to inflict damage. Scatters coins."IThe target is physically pounded with a long tail or a foreleg, etc."NIt enables the user to evade all attacks. It fails if used in succession."iThe user lunges at the target at a speed that makes it almost invisible. It is sure to strike first."sA spin attack that can also eliminate trapping and hazards afflicting your side. Also raises the user's Speed."JRestoring its own cells, the user heals itself by half of its max HP."XThe user recycles a held item that has been used in battle so it can be used again."PThe user reflects the target's type, making it the same type as the target."HThe user rests to cure itself of any non-volatile status condition."hGets revenge for a fainted ally. If an ally fainted in the last turn, this attack's damage doubles."HThe foe is forced to switch out to a random ally. Always goes last."fThe user attacks with a song. Others can join in the Round and make the attack do greater damage."_Hard, pointed, and sharp claws rake the target to inflict damage. Can random critical hit."iThe user blows up to inflict damage on all Pokémon in battle. The user faints upon using this move."HThe user's edges become sharper, raising its Attack by three steps."SThe user shoots a mysterious beam that changes the target's Ability to Simple."jIt enables the user to permanently learn the move last used by the foe. Once used, Sketch disappears."BBy slacking off, the user heals itself by half of its max HP."UThe target is attacked with a slash of claws or blades. Can random critical hit."eThis attack inflicts double damage on a numbed foe. It also cures the target's numbing, however."MThe user emits a snoring sound. This move can only be used while asleep."nThe power stored using the move Stockpile is released all at once in an attack. 150 base power per stack."`The user shines a spotlight on the target so that only it will be attacked during the turn."]The user stockpiles power, reducing move damage taken by 30%. This can be stacked twice."=Used only if the user has no PP. It also hurts the user."TThe user eats its held Berry, then raises Defense and Sp. Def by one step each."rThe user spends 25% HP to create a doll to protect it from move damage, additional effects, and status moves."dThe user chomps hard on the target with its sharp front fangs. It cuts the target's HP to half."PThe user generates odd sound waves from its body. The target becomes dizzy."fThe user consumes its Stockpile to heal itself by 50% of its max HP per stack. This can overheal."OStar-shaped rays are shot at the target. Can't miss and skips protections."SA physical attack in which the user slams into the target with its whole body."RA full-body attack for slamming into the foe. The user also takes 25% recoil."XThe user gets teary eyed. This lowers the target's Attack and Sp. Atk by two steps."aThe user has teatime with all the Pokémon in the battle. Each Pokémon eats its held Berry."jThe user fires a beam of light at its target. The type changes depending on the Drive the user holds."JThe user performs a wobbly dance that dizzies the Pokémon around it."1The user rampages and attacks for two turns."]The user tickles the target into laughing, lowering its Attack and Defense by two steps."ZThe user transforms into a copy of the target right down to having the same move set."rThe user strikes with a simultaneous three-beam attack. It has a 15% chance each to numb, burn, or frostbite."eThe user unleashes its ultimate move. Can't miss and skips protections. Only one use per battle."mThe user attacks in an uproar, going on a rampage for two turns. Over that time, no one can fall asleep."]One turn after this move is used, the target's HP is restored by half the user's max HP."EThe user is roused, raising its Attack and Sp. Atk by two steps."_The user yawns, making the target drowsy. They'll fall asleep at the end of the next turn."ZThe user looses a flurry of open-palmed arm thrusts that multi-hit two to five times."aThe user looses a blast of aura from deep within its body. Can't miss and skips protections."WThe user slams into the opponent, dealing damage based on the user's Defense stat."aThe user attacks with a swift chop. It also breaks any screens protecting the target's side."YThe user tenses its muscles to bulk up, raising its Attack and Defense by two steps."WThe user coaches its ally Pokémon, raising their Attack and Defense by two steps."^A retaliation move that counters any physical attack, inflicting double the damage taken."QThe user delivers a chop with its forearms crossed. Can random critical hit."FThe target is quickly kicked twice in succession using both feet."TAn energy-draining punch. The user's HP is restored by 33% of the damage dealt."[The user risks all to attack the foe. The user faints but does damage equal to its HP."UThe user dives down onto the target from the sky. This move is also Flying-type."9The user focuses its energy and unleashes its power."kThe user focuses its mind before launching a punch. It will fail if the user is hit before it is used."KThe target is attacked with a shock wave. It has a 30% chance to numb."aThe target is attacked with a knee kick from a jump. If it misses, the user is hurt instead."GThe target is attacked with a sharp chop. Can random critical hit."ZThe user attacks the target's legs swiftly, lowering the target's Speed by two steps."NThe user throws a punch at blinding speed. It is certain to strike first."qThe user protects itself and allies from damaging moves. It only works the first turn the user is in battle."QAttacks wildly with swords or fists. The user is exhausted on the next turn."VThe user traps itself into the battle and raises all of their stats by two steps."cLocks the target in and traps it. Lowers target's Defense and Sp. Def by two steps every turn."iStriking opponents repeatedly makes the user's fists harder, raising the user's Attack by two steps."nThe user protects itself and its allies from priority moves. It always fails if it is used in succession."]The user attacks by slicing with its long horns. Ignores the target's stat step changes."eThe user cuts with its long horn. The odd power contained in it does physical damage to the foe."bThe user strikes the target with a fierce blow. This attack always results in a critical hit."cThe user grabs the target and recklessly dives for the ground. The user also takes 33% recoil."jThe user attacks the target with great power. This lowers the user's Attack and Defense by two steps."iThe user kicks the target with lightning-like movement. It lowers the target's Defense by two steps."hThe user whirls its fists to send a wave of pure vacuum at the target. This move always goes first."eThe user nimbly strikes the foe. Doubles in damage if the user has no item when the move starts."[The user confounds the foe with speed, then slashes. Can't miss and skips protections."bThe user attacks with air that slices even the sky. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."fThe user heats up its beak before attacking. If hit by a foe's physical move, burns the attacker."VThe user attacks foes with savagely cold winds. It has a 30% chance to frostbite."aThe user tucks in its wings and strikes from a low altitude. The user also takes 33% recoil."cThe user attacks using a sound wave based on words it has learned. It also dizzies the target."yThe user whips up a wind to blow away protective screens on the opponent's side. Also removes hazards on both sides."ZA corkscrewing attack with the sharp beak acting as a drill. Can random critical hit."PThe user slams the target with its wings. The target is hit twice in a row."`The user covers the target's body with a mass of down that lowers its Attack by five steps."SThe user soars, charging and becoming hidden, then strikes on the second turn.";The user whips up a gust of wind to attack the target."\The user absorbs its target's HP. The user's HP is restored by 75% of the damage dealt."WThe target is jabbed with a sharply pointed beak or horn. Can random critical hit."hThe user pecks the target. If the target is holding a Berry, the user eats it and gains its effect."WThe user heals itself by half of its max HP. The user loses Flying-type this turn."iThe user whips up a turbulent whirlwind that doubles the Speed of all party Pokémon for four turns."ZThe foe is attacked with a spray of harsh acid. It has a 20% chance to lower Sp. Def."hThe user spits fluid that works to melt the target. This lowers the target's Sp. Def by four steps."uThe user lets out a damaging belch at the target. Deals double damage if the user has eaten a berry this battle."bThe user attacks with a cloud of white smoke. This resets the target's positive stat changes."dThe user coils up and concentrates. This raises its Attack, Defense, and Accuracy by two steps."GA slashing attack with a poisonous blade. Can random critical hit."<The user shoots filthy garbage at the target to attack."LThe user bites the target with toxic fangs with a 50% chance to poison."OA cloud of noxious gas is sprayed in the face of the target, poisoning it."dThe target is stabbed with a tentacle or arm seeped with toxins. It has a 10% chance to poison."YThe user stabs the target with a poisonous stinger. This has a 30% chance to poison."EThe user hits the target with its tail. Can random critical hit."lInflicts physical or special damage, whichever will be more effective. This has a 30% chance to poison."NUnsanitary sludge is hurled at the target. It has a 30% chance to poison."JIt swamps the area around the user with a giant wave of toxic sludge."\The target is attacked with an emission of filthy gases. It has a 30% chance to poison."hThe user shoots poisonous threads to poison the target and lowers the target's Speed by four steps."WNearby poisoned foes have their Attack, Sp. Atk, and Speed lowered by three steps."jThe user drenches the foe in a special poisonous liquid. Its power doubles if the target is poisoned."aThe user throws the bone it holds. The bone loops to hit the target twice, coming and 