ne at allies."SThe user raises their Sp. Atk and Sp. Def by two steps, and Speed by one step."IThe user attacks with a beam of light. It has a 30% chance to dizzy."cThe foe is attacked with powdery scales blown by wind. It has a 20% chance to raise all stats."dThe user rolls over its foes, crushing them. It has a 40% chance to lower the target's Defense."tWeaves a sticky net around the opposing team, a hazard which lowers their Speed by two steps upon switching in."xAll nearby foes are bound with silk blown from the user's mouth. This silk lowers the targets' Speed by four steps."eWhile resisting, the user attacks all nearby foes. The targets' Sp. Atk is lowered by two steps."]The user stares at flashing lights to focus its mind, raising its Sp. Atk by five steps."eAfter making its attack, the user rushes back to switch places with a party Pokémon in waiting."[The user slashes at the foe by crossing its scythes or claws. Can random critical hit."qThe user attacks the target while shouting in a startling fashion. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."YThe user attacks by sending a frightful amount of small ghosts at opposing Pokémon."IThe target is exposed to a sinister ray, causing it to become dizzy."bWhen this move is used, if the user faints, the foe that landed the knockout hit also faints."TFor five turns, this move prevents the target from using the move it last used."{The user hexes the target with evil magic. This deals double damage if the target has a non-volatile status condition."ZThe target is licked with a long tongue, causing damage. It has a 30% chance to numb."dThe user emits a sinister ray. This move can be used on the target regardless of its Abilities."fThe user blasts the target with a gust of repulsive wind. It has a 20% chance to raise all stats."bThe user adds its HP to the target's HP, then equally shares the combined HP with the target."_Any Pokémon that hears this song faints in three turns, unless it switches out of battle."VThe user 