he foe slams the target with its steel-hard head. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."kProtects the user from damage this turn. It also lowers the Attack of physical attackers by two steps."hThe user focuses intensely. For the next three turns, its attacks will be guaranteed critical hits."VA retaliation move that counters any attack, inflicting 150% of the damage taken."OThe target is raked with steel claws. It has a 20% chance to raise Attack."TA horrible sound like scraping metal lowers the target's Sp. Def by four steps."bThe target is hit with a hard punch fired like a meteor. It has a 20% chance to raise Attack."KThe user rotates its gears, raising its Attack and Speed by two steps."fFires a beam of steel that it collected from its entire body. The user loses half its current HP."\The target is hit with wings of steel. It has a 30% chance to raise the user's Defense."iThe user slams into the target with the force of a meteor. Can't be stopped by the target's Ability."_A frenetic dance to uplift the fighting spirit. It raises the user's Attack by four steps."VThe target is razed by a fiery explosion. The user is exhausted on the next turn."AThe user launches a fiery kick. It has a 10% chance to burn."ZAttacks with energy from jealousy. All opposing Pokémon with stat boosts get burned."yTo inflict massive damage, the user uses up its Fire-typing. This move can't be used if the user is not a Fire type."KThe target is attacked with small flames. It has a 10% chance to burn."gThe user attacks in an explosive fury. Weakens in damage as the user loses HP. Weakest at half HP."EThe foe is attacked with an intense blast of all-consuming fire."yThe user bites with flame-cloaked fangs. It has a 20% chance to burn and a 20% chance to lower Defense by two steps."iThe user strikes the target with a flaming lash. This also lowers the target's Defense by two steps."tA column of fire hits the target. When used with its Grass equivalent, it creates a Sea of Fire for four turns."JThe target is punched with a fiery fist. It has a 10% chance to burn."[The user engulfs the target in fierce flames, trapping and binding it for three turns."eThe user cloaks itself in flame and attacks. Building up more power, it raises the user's Speed."WThe target is scorched with an intense blast of fire. It has a 10% chance to burn."ZThe user cloaks itself in fire and rushes at the target. It has a 30% chance to burn."LThe user runs at the foe while on fire. The user also takes 33% recoil."The user slams the opposing side with its flaming body. The heavier the user is compared to the target, the greater the damage."_The user attacks by exhaling hot breath on the opposing team. It has a 20% chance to burn."nThe user attacks all foes nearby with fire. The targets' held Berry or Gem becomes burnt up and unusable."cThe user attacks by engulfing the target in an intense fire. It leaves the target with a burn."UThe user spews magma around the target, trapping and binding it for three turns."dThe user attacks everything by causing its own head to explode. The user also takes 50% recoil."kThe user attacks by breathing a special, hot fire. This also lowers the target's Sp. Atk by two steps."]The user attacks the target at full power. This lowers the user's Sp. Atk by four steps."HAttacks by igniting a small stone and launching it as a fiery ball."FThe user rampages and attacks while spewing flames for two turns."vThe user rigs its shell to explode. If hit by a foe's physical move, the shell detonates and hurts all near foes."~With a fiery forehead, the user hurls itself at the foe. This lowers the user's Defense, Sp. Def, and Speed by two steps."TIf the target's HP is half or less, this attack will hit with double the power."\A spray of bubbles is jetted at the target. This has a 20% chance to lower their Speed."\A spray of bubbles is forcefully ejected at the target. It also lowers the foe's Speed."NThe user clamps onto the target, trapping and binding it for three turns."oDiving on the first turn, charging and becoming hidden, the user hits from below water on the second turn."gRends the target with its hard gills. Deals 50% more damage unless the target has moved this turn."SThe target is hit with a watery blast. The user is exhausted on the next turn."SThe target is blasted by a huge volume of water launched under great pressure."bThe user scatters mysterious water around and heals itself and allies by 25% of their max HP."USlams into the target using an aquatic blast with a 20% chance to lower Defense."dThe user attacks opposing Pokémon with a pulse of water which glows a deep and brilliant blue."SThe user cuts the foe with sharp shells. It has a 50% chance to lower Defense."TThe user shoots boiling hot water at its target. This has a 30% chance to burn."�The user breaks its shell. This raises the user's Attack, Sp. Atk and Speed by three steps, but lowers Defense and Sp. Def by two steps."QThe target is struck with a supersonic water blast. Can random critical hit."qThe user bursts into a bubbly song. Pokémon hit by this are cured of burn. Deals 50% less damage to allies."VThe user immerses the target in superheated steam. This has a 30% chance to burn."WIt swamps the area with a giant wave, hitting every battler nearby and underwater."bStrikes the target thrice, with mastery of the Water style. Always results in a critical hit."MThe user lunges at the target and has a 40% chance to flinch the target."RThe target is blasted with a forceful shot of water. Can random critical hit."pA column of water hits the target. When used with its Fire equivalent, it creates a Rainbow for four turns."gThe user multi-hits the target two to five times with throwing stars. This move always goes first."iThe user spouts water to damage the foe. Weakens in damage as the user loses HP. Weakest at half HP."VA nutrient-draining attack. The user's HP is restored by 50% of the damage dealt."qThe user releases a soothing scent that heals all non-volatile status conditions affecting the user's party."UThe user forcefully shoots seeds at the target. It multi-hits two to five times."sThe user launches its amassed chlorophyll to inflict damage on the target. The user loses half its current HP."eThe user protects itself by wrapping its body in soft cotton, raising its Defense by five steps."lThe user releases cotton-like spores that cling to all foes nearby, lowering their Speed by four steps."\The user attacks with the essence of life. It has a 20% chance to raise user's Sp. Atk."]The user slams the target with an enormous tree. The user is exhausted on the next turn."hThe user snares the target with grass and trips it. The heavier the target, the greater the damage."tA column of grass hits the target. When used with its Water equivalent, it creates a vast Swamp for four turns."eThe user's body grows all at once, raising Attack and Sp. Atk by two steps, or four in sunshine."pThe user heals itself and allies by 25% of their max HP, as well as healing non-volatile status conditions."QThe user attacks by pelting the target with leaves. Can random critical hit."aThe user handles a sharp leaf like a sword and attacks by slashing. Can random critical hit."YA storm of sharp leaves is whipped up. This lowers the user's Sp. Atk by four steps."CA seed is planted on the target, causing it to become leeched."VThe user scatters leaves that chase the target. Can't miss and skips protections."FThe user attacks by scattering petals in a rampage for two turns."TThe user violently whirls its vines, tentacles, or the like to lash the target."\Sharp-edged leaves are launched to slash at the opposing team. Can random critical hit."]The user generates a shock wave from within its body. This lower's the target's Sp. Def."VThe user charges, then attacks on the second turn. Charges instantly in sunshine."MProtects the user from attacks. Physical attackers take 1/8th HP damage."SThe user scatters bursts of spores that induce sleep. Only one use per battle."JLowers the target's Attack, then heals itself by the target's Attack."EThe user heals itself by half of its max HP, or 66% in sunshine."nThe user lands an intense tropical kick on the target. This also lowers the target's Attack by two steps."7The target is struck with slender, whiplike vines."^The user slams its rugged body into the target to attack. The user also takes 33% recoil."cAttacks with an electrified beak. Deals 50% more damage unless the target has moved this turn."|The user becomes energized, doubling the power of its next Electric-type attack. Also raises the user's Defense and Sp. Def."bThe user fires a concentrated bundle of electricity, raising the user's Sp. Atk by two steps."[The user's body generates an eerie impulse. Lowers the target's Sp. Atk by four steps."[The user hurls an electric orb at the foe. It does more damage the faster the user is."hThe user captures and attacks foes by using an electric net, which lowers their Speed by two steps."NThe user levitates using electrically generated magnetism for five turns."dThe user nuzzles its electrified cheeks against the target. This also leaves the target numbed."aThe user attacks everything around it. The user's HP is restored by 50% of the damage dealt."^The user attacks with electrically infused fists. Normal-type moves become Electric-type."dThe user strikes the target with a quick jolt of electricity. Can't miss and skips protections."UThe user throws an electrical tackle at the target. It has a 30% chance to numb."ZCan't miss in rainstorm. It has a 30% chance to numb. Can hit targets flying high up."RA strong electric blast is loosed at the target. It has a 10% chance to numb."fThe user throws a cage of electricity around the target, trapping and binding it for three turns."wThe user bites with electrified fangs. It has a 20% chance to numb and a 20% chance to lower Defense by two steps."QThe target is punched with an electrified fist. It has a 10% chance to numb."_A jolt of electricity is hurled at the foe to inflict damage. It has a 10% chance to numb."RThe user lunges at the foe while electrified. The user also takes 33% recoil."YThe user savagely attacks foes with lightning and wind. It has a 30% chance to numb."eThe user shrouds itself in electricity and smashes into its foe. The user also takes 25% recoil."XThe user fires an electric blast like a cannon to inflict damage and cause numbing."bA strong electric blast crashes down on the target. It has a 60% chance to flinch the target."\The user relaxes and lightens its body to move faster, raising its Speed by four steps."nThe user temporarily empties its mind to forget its concerns. It raises the user's Sp. Def by four steps."UThe user quietly focuses its mind to raise its Sp. Atk and Sp. Def by two steps."bThe user casts a horrible spell on the opponent. This removes 4 PP from their last used move."aThe user shoots its psychic power from its eyes to attack. It has a 20% chance to frostbite."dThe user foretells an attack. Two turns later, a hunk of psychic energy hits the targeted spot."qThe user employs psychic power to average its unmodified Defense and Sp. Def stats with those of its target."}The user faints. In return, the Pokémon taking its place will have its HP restored and non-volatile status conditions cured."VThe user emits a healing pulse which heals the target's HP by half of its max HP."bThe user unleashes a vicious blow after a cute act. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."TThe user employs its psychic power to switch stat step changes with the target."�Using a hyperspace hole, the user appears next to the target and strikes. Can't miss, skips Substitutes and destroys protections."GThe user instructs the target to use the target's last move again."oA wondrous screen is put up to halve special attacks for five turns, or reduce it by 33% in multi battles."}The user faints. In return, the Pokémon taking its place will have its non-volatile status conditions and HP fully restored."_Until end of turn, reflects status moves that target the user or create hazards around it."]A retaliation move that counters any special attack, inflicting double the damage taken."pThe user employs psychic power to average its unmodified Attack and Sp. Atk stats with those of the target."NThe target is attacked with a peculiar ray. It has a 30% chance to dizzy."pThe user bites the target using psychic capabilities. Also breaks any screens protecting the target's side."_The user tears at the target with blades formed by psychic power. Can random critical hit."oUsing its psychic power of suggestion, the user transfers its non-volatile status condition to the target."PThe user hypnotizes itself into copying any stat change made by the target."pCloaking itself in psychic energy, the user slams into the target, raising the user's Defense by two steps."pA wondrous screen is put up to halve physical attacks for five turns, or reduce it by 33% in multi battles."bThe user goes to sleep to fully restore their HP and heal any non-volatile status conditions."QThe user mimics the target completely, copying the target's natural Ability."NThe user employs its psychic power to exchange Abilities with the target."nThe user focuses its willpower to its head and attacks the foe. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."XThe target is hit with a rainbow-colored beam. It has a 40% chance to lower Attack."�The user puts up a rainbow-colored screen to halve move damage for five turns, or reduce it by 33% in multi battles. Only usable in hail."\A blizzard strikes all near foes. Can't miss in hail. It has a 30% chance to frostbite."^The user blows a cold breath on the target. This attack always results in a critical hit."VThe user attacks by hurling a blizzard-cloaked icicle lance at opposing Pokémon."MSummons hail for six turns. Damages non-Ice, non-Ghost-types every turn."\The target is struck with an icy-cold beam of energy. It has a 10% chance to frostbite."}The user bites with cold-infused fangs. It has a 20% chance to frostbite and a 20% chance to lower Defense by two steps."NThe target is punched with an icy fist. It has a 10% chance to frostbite."dThe user flash freezes chunks of ice and hurls them at the target. This move always goes first."TThe user launches sharp icicles at the target. It multi-hits two to five times."aThe user attacks with a gust of chilled air. It also lowers the targets' Speed by two steps."]The user attacks with a chilling gust of powdery snow. It has a 10% chance to frostbite."The user swings its tail wildly at opposing Pokémon, lowering their Attack or Sp. Atk (whichever is higher) by two steps."RThe user raises all its stats by two steps, at the cost of 33% of its max HP."MThe user sends out a telluric shockwave, damaging and dizzying all foes."YComets are summoned down from the sky. This lowers the user's Sp. Atk by four steps."VThe user exhales a mighty gust that inflicts damage. It has a 30% chance to numb."8The user slashes the target with huge, sharp claws."mThe user vigorously performs a mystic, powerful dance, raising its Attack by two steps and Speed by one."oAttacks all enemy Pokémon with pure vitality. Weakens in damage as the user loses HP. Weakest at half HP."RThe user uses its body like a hammer to attack the target and inflict damage."SThe target is attacked with a shock wave generated by the user's gaping mouth."ZThe user forces the target to switch out, to be replaced at random. Always goes last."4The user unleashes a strong beam from its core."[The most powerful attack of the original form. The user is exhausted on the next turn."kThe user attacks with apocalyptic light. This ignores their ability. Changes Necrozma's form upon use."kThe user blasts the target with power that distorts even time. The user is exhausted on the next turn."WThe user tears the target along with the space around it. Can random critical hit."OA small tornado hits the target. It has a 40% 