on spikes on the foe's side. One layer hurts switched in foes, two layers poisons."sThe user jabs the target with its stinger while retreating. This poisons the target and switches the user out."NThe user attacks with sticky slime, rendering the target's item unusable."]The user punches the target while holding a wad of slime. It has a 30% chance to poison."hThe user uses venom that turns the target's body against it. Super effective versus Fighting-types."\Attacks with energy from jealousy. All opposing Pokémon with stat boosts get poisoned."[The user gives off a terrible stench towards the target. It has a 30% chance to dizzy."iThe target is forced to switch out by a stinky cloud, then the user also switches. Always goes last."LThe user bites the target with toxic fangs with a 30% chance to poison."_The user chomps with venomous teeth. The user's HP is restored by 33% of the damage dealt."EThe target is given a Black Sludge, replacing their item if any."]Halves attack damage taken this turn. Poisons any attackers. Fails if used successively."CThe user blasts a bundle of venom at the target, poisoning it."OThe user finishes off its prey. Power is tripled against poisoned targets."WThe user opens a rift beneath the target, trapping and binding it for three turns."WThe target is consumed by a desert storm, trapping and binding it for three turns."^The user whips up a hot desert twister to attack the target. It has a 30% chance to burn."PThe user whips up dirt at supersonic speeds, damaging everything around it."sThe user cracks the earth under the target with a massive strike. This lowers the user's Attack by four steps."aAttacks by blasting dirt and debris at the target. This move always goes first in sandstorm."mThe user uses all their might to attack their opponent, forcing the user to use Rest on their next turn."`The user stabilizes its stance. This raises its Attack, Sp. Def, and Accuracy by two steps."aEnergy is sent through a conduit, erupting under the targe