ake a damaging sound wave. It has a 40% chance to lower Sp. Def."LVenom is introduced into the target with fangs or spines, poisoning it."fThe user consumes a bit of the target's blood. The user's HP is restored by 50% the damage dealt."JThe user emits an aroma that raises the target's three weakest stats."cThe user applies a painful chemical to the target with a smack. It has a 10% chance to poison."�The user stabs the target with a sharp spike to drain its life force. The user's HP is restored by 50% of the damage dealt. This can overheal."ZThe user attacks with small beams of light. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."EThe user emits rapid bursts of light and rampages for two turns."hThe user attacks with a blinding flash of bioluminscence. It has a 40% chance to flinch the target."jAll foes have their Attack and Sp. Atk lowered. All foes' moves get redirected to the user this turn."<The foe is stabbed once by each of the user's stingers."sThe user makes a plea for survival, halving the damage their side takes from non-attack sources for ten turns."mThe user prepares its weapons. This raises the user's Attack by six steps but lowers Speed by six steps."0The user rakes the target with sharp claws."xThe user bites, claws, and stings the target while rolling. It has a 20% chance each to poison, waterlog, or leech."^The target is plastered with irritating scales, damaging it and changing its type to Bug."xThe user sheds a huge volley of scales at the target. Lands without fail. This lowers the user's Sp. Def and Speed."GThe user scratches the target with a flurry of claws, talons, etc."fIf the user is faster than the target, puts the target to sleep, then minimizes the user's Speed."kThe user stabs through the target using tremendous force. This lowers the user's Attack by four steps."gAvenging bugs everywhere, the user crushes the target. It has a 20% chance to lower their Defense."\The user stabs the target, injecting a painful chemical. It has a 30% chance 