iewed anytime. It even shows your present location."ZA flower that conveys gratitude. Use it to transform Shaymin into or out of Sky form."iA splicer that fuses Kyurem and a certain Pokémon. They are said to have been one in the beginning."qA glass that reveals the truth. It is a mysterious glass that returns a Pokémon back to its original shape."HA shiny charm which doubles the chance of finding a Shiny Pokémon."YA charm in the shape of a tooth. It increases the EXP. gained from EXP Candy by 15%."_A comforting charm which doubles the happiness your Pokémon gain from being close to you."pA shiny red orb that is said to have a legend tied to it. It's known to be connected with the Hoenn region."qA shiny blue orb that is said to have a legend tied to it. It's known to be connected with the Hoenn region."]Reshiram's body, in stone form. An expert in ancient relics may be able to transform it."[Zekrom's body, in stone form. An expert in ancient relics may be able to transform it."jA popular treat in Lumiose City. It can be used once to heal all the status conditions of a Pokémon."kShalour City's famous shortbread. It can be used once to heal all the status conditions of a Pokémon."tThe Alola region's specialty--fried bread. It can be used once to heal all the status conditions of a Pokémon."kA capsule that allows a Pokémon with two Abilities to switch between these Abilities when it is used."eA bottle believed to have been used to seal away the power of a certain Pokémon long, long ago."AA machine to fuse Necrozma, which needs light, and Solgaleo."?A machine to fuse Necrozma, which needs light, and Lunala."XAn item holding Zygarde's Cores and Cells. You can use it to change Zygarde's form."hA candy that is packed with energy. When consumed, it will grant a single Pokémon 250 Exp. Points."iA candy that is packed with energy. When consumed, it will grant a single Pokémon 1000 Exp. Points."jA candy that is packed with energy. When consumed, it will grant a single Pokémon 4