 didn't earn enough XP for you to earn any candies back."?It didn't earn enough XP for you to earn any candies back."?You are reimbursed for {1} percent of the EXP they earned."=You are reimbursed for {1} percent of the EXP it earned.":They never gained any EXP, so no candies are awarded."8It never gained any EXP, so no candies are awarded."	Jump"Wallpaper"Search"	Sort"Sort All"Sort Unlock"Sort Lock"Swap Box"Jump to which Box?"Pick the wallpaper."Box name?"Search how?"Which name?"Which species?"Which type?"Which tribe?"7Can't sort while you have a Pokémon in your hand!"The box is sort locked!"The box is empty."How will you sort?"1Each Pokémon is already in the right place!"=Can't swap boxes while you have a Pokémon in your hand!"Swap with which Box?"That's the current box!"'{1} has swapped position with {2}!"No boxes were sorted."Only one box was sorted."{1} boxes were sorted!"'There is no EXP stored in the {1}!"0Mass feed this box of Pokemon from the {1}?"0No Pokemon in this box can receive any EXP."
